							<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1383732519965_778792_3109' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;TerminalPairingSpecification&lt;/i&gt; is a container for various &lt;i&gt;TerminalPairing&lt;/i&gt;. A &lt;i&gt;TerminalPairing&lt;/i&gt; is an aspect of part master definition of terminals and represents a specific pair of terminals pluggable to each other. It specifies properties of that terminal pair in combination with a specific &lt;i&gt;ConductorSpecification.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
								<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F2A13DD1_8F76_4708_AA22_786D5C5D3259'/>
							</ownedComment>
