							</xmi:Extension>
							<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637329183260_801712_6137' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;HousingComponent&lt;/i&gt; of an E/E-Component has two major use cases:&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;ol&gt;&#10;      &lt;li&gt;&#10;Other E/E-Components can be plugged into it (e.g. Fuses, Relays, Harnesses).&#10;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#10;      &lt;li&gt;&#10;Wire can be contacted directly into the &lt;i&gt;HousingComponent &lt;/i&gt;(without an additional connector)&#10;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;In the first case, no connection to the harness topology is required. Either because there is no harness topology (e.g. a Fuse), or because the end point of the topology is the harness connector itself (which is plugged into the housing component). However, for the latter case, &lt;i&gt;HousingComponent&lt;/i&gt; itself is the endpoint of the wires and thus of the harness topology. Like a connector, an E/E-component and its &lt;i&gt;HousingComponents&lt;/i&gt; can have multiple different points at which &lt;i&gt;TopologyNode &lt;/i&gt;can be connected and not all &lt;i&gt;HousingComponents &lt;/i&gt;and&lt;i&gt; Cavities&lt;/i&gt; are reachable from a connecting point.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Reusing the &lt;i&gt;SegmentConnectionPoint&lt;/i&gt; of the &lt;i&gt;ConnectorHousingSpecification&lt;/i&gt; is not sufficent, because a single &lt;i&gt;ConnectorHousingSpecification&lt;/i&gt; can be used by different &lt;i&gt;HousingComponents &lt;/i&gt;and the definition would be ambiguous.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Therefore, a &lt;i&gt;HousingComponent &lt;/i&gt;can define multiple &lt;i&gt;SegmentConnectionPointHC &lt;/i&gt;representing the valid options for this specific &lt;i&gt;HousingComponent&lt;/i&gt; to attach to a &lt;i&gt;TopologyNode.&lt;/i&gt; The definition of cavity reachability and wire addons is specified with the &lt;i&gt;SegmentConnectionPoint&lt;/i&gt; of the &lt;i&gt;ConnectorHousingSpecification. &lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;SegmentConnectionPointHC&lt;/i&gt; can reference the &lt;i&gt;SegmentConnectionPoint&lt;/i&gt; which is used to &amp;quot;enter&amp;quot; the connector housing&lt;i&gt;.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
								<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1637327067156_946217_5447'/>
							</ownedComment>
						</ownedDiagram>
					</modelExtension>
				</xmi:Extension>
			</packagedElement>
		</packagedElement>
		<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Package' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659517029485_44069_5529' name='VEC Model Consistency'>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659517029486_381806_5530' name='No Association Multiplicity'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Property'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Property' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659517029487_586881_5533'>
					<body>isNavigable() implies not ((lowerValue.oclIsUndefined()) or (upperValue.oclIsUndefined()))</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659529585257_264304_5823' name='Nameless Association End'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Association'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Association' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659529585258_960964_5824'>
					<body>self.memberEnd-&gt;forAll (n | (n.isNavigable() implies  (n.name &lt;&gt; &#39;&#39;)))</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659532044712_965372_5907' name='Only VEC types used'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Property'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Property' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659532044712_602826_5908'>
					<body>type.qualifiedName.startsWith(&#39;VEC&#39;)</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659532777179_621949_5914' name='No type defined'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Property'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Property' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659532777179_281474_5915'>
					<body>isNavigable() implies not (type.oclIsUndefined())</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1702889509827_940277_1698' name='Enum Literals start Upper Case'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#EnumerationLiteral'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::EnumerationLiteral' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1702889509843_272030_1701'>
					<body>name.substring(1,1).matches(&#39;^[A-Z#0-9]*$&#39;)</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1703144457696_985085_2483' name='test'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Class'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Class' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1703144457696_379817_2484'>
					<body>THIS.superClass</body>
					<language>Groovy</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750083199934_453374_2651' name='StructuredPrimitive no superclass allowed'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Class'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Class' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750083199934_524162_2652'>
					<body>self.appliedStereotype-&gt;exists(s | s.name = &#39;StructuredPrimitive&#39;) 
    implies self.generalization.general-&gt;forAll(g | (g.appliedStereotype-&gt;exists(x | x.name = &#39;StructuredPrimitive&#39;) ))</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750145122556_168254_1742' name='StructuredPrimitive not referenceable'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Association'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Association' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750145122557_632582_1743'>
					<body>self.memberEnd-&gt;forAll(e | (not e.type.appliedStereotype-&gt;exists(s | s.name = &#39;StructuredPrimitive&#39;) or not (e.isNavigable() and e.aggregation &lt;&gt; AggregationKind::composite )))</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750146334953_674448_1744' name='All classes should be ExtendableElements or StructurePrimitive'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Class'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Class' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750146334957_771630_1745'>
					<body>self.appliedStereotype-&gt;exists(s | s.name = &#39;StructuredPrimitive&#39;) or 
self.generalization-&gt;notEmpty() or 
self.name = &#39;ExtendableElement&#39; or 
self.appliedStereotype-&gt;exists(s | s.name = &#39;Legend&#39;)
</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
			<ownedRule xmi:type='uml:Constraint' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750148614304_931238_1846' name='MustInheritStructuredPrimitiveConsistently'>
				<constrainedElement href='http://www.omg.org/spec/UML/20131001/UML.xmi#Class'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='UML Standard Profile::UML2 Metamodel::Class' referentType='Class'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</constrainedElement>
				<specification xmi:type='uml:OpaqueExpression' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750148614305_292381_1847'>
					<body>self.generalization.general-&gt;exists(g | 
  g.appliedStereotype-&gt;exists(s | s.name = &#39;StructuredPrimitive&#39;)
) implies 
self.appliedStereotype-&gt;exists(s | s.name = &#39;StructuredPrimitive&#39;)</body>
					<language>OCL2.0</language>
				</specification>
			</ownedRule>
		</packagedElement>
		<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
			<modelPart name='com.nomagic.magicdraw.uml_model.shared_model'>
				<packagedElement href='local:/PROJECT-195e27c6-e36a-4b96-9301-e34bebde338f?resource=com.nomagic.magicdraw.uml_umodel.shared_umodel#_17_0_2_854026d_1382694716726_877882_13011'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<referenceExtension referentPath='VEC' referentType='Package'/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</packagedElement>
			</modelPart>
		</xmi:Extension>
		<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Package' xmi:id='_17_0_2_854026d_1382694716726_877882_13011' name='VEC'>
			<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Package' xmi:id='EAPK_641D9B76_FD5B_4288_81BA_FD585EE57A9C' name='terminal_pairing'>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_87D6B581_0182_4b08_86CE_15493169EF31' name='TerminalPairing'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_87D6B581_0182_4b08_86CE_15493169EF31Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;TerminalPairing&lt;/i&gt; is a standard reference setup of exactly two terminals and a defined length of a core contacted to both terminals. The &lt;i&gt;TerminalPairing &lt;/i&gt;defines physical properties that apply to this combination (e.g. &lt;i&gt;contactResistance)&lt;/i&gt;. Other values might be independent from a specific conductor (e.g. &lt;i&gt;matingForce&lt;/i&gt;).&amp;#160;Therefore, the &lt;i&gt;referencedCoreSpecification&lt;/i&gt; is optional.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_87D6B581_0182_4b08_86CE_15493169EF31'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_0F9239A6_7C7B_4fe7_BE3D_5FBF8F3FF522' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_0D4D4C81_51A5_444c_A6E3_F0EBBBB9DDE2' name='contactResistance' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_0D4D4C81_51A5_444c_A6E3_F0EBBBB9DDE2Documentation' body='Specifies the resistance of the terminal pairing.'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_0D4D4C81_51A5_444c_A6E3_F0EBBBB9DDE2'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000023_51A5_444c_A6E3_F0EBBBB9DDE2'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000024_51A5_444c_A6E3_F0EBBBB9DDE2' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_B5137560_8EFF_4293_A08C_943199AD9599' name='matingForce' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B5137560_8EFF_4293_A08C_943199AD9599Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the joining force of the two terminals.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B5137560_8EFF_4293_A08C_943199AD9599'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000025_8EFF_4293_A08C_943199AD9599'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1561382504113_350279_6766' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst8A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04' name='referencedCoreSpecification' visibility='public' type='EAID_58B1BEDB_9393_4275_87CB_E943E3F5D823' association='EAID_108A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000027__7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750078890463_69649_2251' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D' name='secondTerminal' visibility='public' type='EAID_A784D820_0381_42ed_8168_0F1AE554D91B' association='EAID_CEC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000029__73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000030__73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB' name='firstTerminal' visibility='public' type='EAID_A784D820_0381_42ed_8168_0F1AE554D91B' association='EAID_D4520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000031__C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000032__C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1561382543756_583962_6767' name='unmatingForce' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1561383108800_951193_6774' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the force required to unmate the two terminals.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1561382543756_583962_6767'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1561382626540_725668_6770'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1561382626540_347995_6771' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750079041361_678309_2252' name='matingCycles' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698667677_845864_2388'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750079080395_694385_2256' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;The maximum number of mating cycles, this terminal combination is certified for. &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1750079041361_678309_2252'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750079070193_155471_2254'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750079070194_144674_2255' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_108A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst8A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src8A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_108A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the CoreSpecification that is used on both sides of the ContactSystem.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_108A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src8A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04' visibility='public' type='EAID_87D6B581_0182_4b08_86CE_15493169EF31' association='EAID_108A8DA8_7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000389__7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000390__7265_453b_B407_73459EC6FB04' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_CEC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_CEC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the second terminal of the TerminalPairing (first and second does not imply any specific order).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_CEC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D' visibility='public' type='EAID_87D6B581_0182_4b08_86CE_15493169EF31' association='EAID_CEC35BCC_73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000203__73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000204__73E8_41c5_8963_C493DF30923D' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_D4520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_D4520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBBDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the first terminal of the TerminalPairing.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_D4520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB' visibility='public' type='EAID_87D6B581_0182_4b08_86CE_15493169EF31' association='EAID_D4520C13_C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000205__C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000206__C8A0_44ea_8AC6_2DDE39FDAFBB' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_89E0AD49_37D1_437a_9DA6_8923BB3C2F03'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstE0AD49_37D1_437a_9DA6_8923BB3C2F03'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcE0AD49_37D1_437a_9DA6_8923BB3C2F03'/>
