						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1728547973016_66924_1830' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1729257678273_400890_1726' name='absoluteSealPosition' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1729258012331_310715_1730' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;absoluteSealPosition&lt;/i&gt; defines distance between the conductor tip and edge of the &lt;i&gt;CavitySeal &lt;/i&gt;facing the conductor tip.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1729257678273_400890_1726'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1729257719962_900919_1728'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1729257719963_407627_1729' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066576_22664_3015' name='pullOffForce' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066577_316546_3018' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The minimum force, of this specific wire mounting situation, that the completed crimp should withstand when wire is being pulled off the terminal. Above that force, the crimp can be expected to be destroyed at any time. This values applies when both core &amp;amp;&amp;#160;insulation crimp are functional.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066576_22664_3015'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066577_760365_3019'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066577_35082_3017' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167053815_357267_3010' name='corePullOffForce' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167053816_61510_3012' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The minimum force, of this specific wire mounting situation,  that the completed crimp should withstand when wire is being pulled off the terminal. Above that force, the crimp can be expected to be destroyed at any time. This values applies when only the&amp;#160;core crimp is present or functional (insulation crimp is either not present or disabled).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167053815_357267_3010'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167053816_791867_3013'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167053815_743639_3011' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066577_114710_3016' name='insulationPullOffForce' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066577_137406_3021' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The minimum force, of this specific wire mounting situation, that the completed crimp should withstand when wire is being pulled off the terminal. Above that force, the crimp can be expected to be destroyed at any time. This values applies when only the&amp;#160;insulation crimp is functional.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066577_114710_3016'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066577_371806_3022'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750167066577_91972_3020' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
