				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_32C19FD5_E9AC_4356_94A9_0A621DB4874C' name='ItemVersion' isAbstract='true'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_32C19FD5_E9AC_4356_94A9_0A621DB4874CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Abstract super-class for physical objects (e.g. a Terminal), virtual objects (e.g. a 150% Harness) as well as documents (e.g. a wiring diagram). In difference to AP 212 the VEC makes it only possible to describe/exchange information about Versions since Master-Objects cannot exist without one or more Versions.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_32C19FD5_E9AC_4356_94A9_0A621DB4874C'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_B7E09487_C645_4960_AF5B_21380CF81588' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_7C13F8D8_50FB_4858_AE38_C63A6DB8D937' name='abbreviation' visibility='public' type='EAID_6E33CD1B_63D7_4da8_BED4_828037944989'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_7C13F8D8_50FB_4858_AE38_C63A6DB8D937Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Room for a short name of the Item. In case of a document the attribute is wanted to contain its title.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_7C13F8D8_50FB_4858_AE38_C63A6DB8D937'/>
