							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000196__33FC_4890_AEBC_1A487D935A03' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_C5C3D65B_E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8D'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstC3D65B_E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8D'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcC3D65B_E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8D'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_C5C3D65B_E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the &lt;i&gt;PartVersions&lt;/i&gt; to which this &lt;i&gt;UsageConstraintSpecification&lt;/i&gt; applies.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_C5C3D65B_E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8D'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcC3D65B_E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8D' visibility='public' type='EAID_FF38707A_7B84_48b7_B1D0_4E18C5F2130A' association='EAID_C5C3D65B_E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8D'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000201__E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8D'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000202__E0D4_447d_9DBB_C08C7AFFFE8D' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_F969BBB1_C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst69BBB1_C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src69BBB1_C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_F969BBB1_C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162Documentation'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F969BBB1_C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src69BBB1_C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162' visibility='public' type='EAID_7E63E658_3237_4505_9A04_5273F76AF75C' association='EAID_F969BBB1_C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000207__C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000208__C1F9_4fd2_A095_D5923A817162' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='EAID_95EFB873_9AFB_4577_9F2A_D19BD7B1EA6A' name='PrimaryPartType'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_95EFB873_9AFB_4577_9F2A_D19BD7B1EA6ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The primary type of the part defines the type of the part (e.g. ConnectorHousing, Fixing, etc.) Since the VEC supports dual use parts (e.g. Fixing &amp;amp; WireProtection) the primary part type is necessary to define which specification associated to part is the primary character of the part. Therefore, all primary part types correspond to a PartOrUsageRelatedSpecification (e.g. ConnectorHousing --&amp;gt; ConnectorHousingSpecification).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The primary part type &#39;&lt;i&gt;Other&lt;/i&gt;&#39; is used if the PartVersion is not further specified by the VEC, which means it has no PartOrUsageRelatedSpecification, only a GeneralTechnicalPartSpecification or a direct instance of PartOrUsageRelatedSpecification.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_95EFB873_9AFB_4577_9F2A_D19BD7B1EA6A'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_CF5E2DFD_E971_4889_8036_5F03AFF58BEE' name='Antenna'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_676732A2_816D_4c57_8E43_6D925B1E75C9' name='Battery'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_169CA521_6E8E_42c8_B3B9_72BB2D2A1B6A' name='BoltMountedFixing'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1522918639259_663564_6596' name='BoltTerminal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691054480518_852342_3787' name='BridgeTerminal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_DB653C76_FDB1_48f9_84DE_DA96A4C1D896' name='CableDuct'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1465909377354_80341_2643' name='CableTie'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1535553418284_247111_7014' name='Capacitor'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481557969184_272368_2895' name='CavityAccessory'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_1EC54E17_CFA7_460b_9EED_D65B7235C650' name='CavityPlug'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_90E2CE4C_0C3B_4db8_87AA_1D5EF80C6E0F' name='CavitySeal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1728574078961_437896_2053' name='Coating'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_D2690476_272E_4a1d_BC9D_CEDE2B48C9A9' name='ConnectorHousing'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1443700034959_25379_2766' name='ConnectorHousingCap'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1703758522207_142033_4295' name='ConnectorHousingCover'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_26DD88B8_7498_4542_9C28_9726121CB029' name='CorrugatedPipe'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1535553406042_80748_7012' name='Diode'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1445361752058_567193_2849' name='EdgeMountedFixing'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_BD5C90A5_FCC2_4416_B03C_75E5B9B5F7BB' name='EEComponent'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1576486161500_56547_5692' name='Ferrite'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_6C794F90_5077_487b_8E84_A6785DD07B47' name='Fitting'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_12CAD14C_AE35_470d_838C_F60159F69775' name='Fixing'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_C55EC9B7_07F6_4656_A12D_25E57DB363FD' name='Fuse'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_75BA77FB_E9D2_40dc_97CD_0175323433BF' name='Grommet'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_1E7EA5F1_9837_484c_8D3C_CE0AF15878A5' name='HoleMountedFixing'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_ED01AB37_6C98_40dc_B0CF_5914E13BC8B0' name='MultiCavityPlug'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_5A383D7E_B0EA_4239_8AF3_A11649D3E92C' name='MultiCavitySeal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1464859128197_996334_2604' name='MultiFuse'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_FCE016CA_5A4D_44a1_ACBE_B63D624D9E87' name='Other'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691054762455_516243_3853' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;PrimaryPartType &lt;/i&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;i&gt;Other&lt;/i&gt;&amp;quot; is used for parts that are described by a direct instance of &lt;i&gt;PartOrUsageRelatedSpecification&lt;/i&gt;. These are parts that do not have a specific classification in the VEC and can be described with a &lt;i&gt;PartOrUsageRelatedSpecification&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;CustomProperties.&lt;/i&gt; The corresponding &lt;i&gt;Role&lt;/i&gt; is the &lt;i&gt;SpecificRole.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_FCE016CA_5A4D_44a1_ACBE_B63D624D9E87'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691054610106_392069_3792' name='OpenWireEndTerminal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1535553520152_854779_7277' name='OpenWireEnd'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_08FD4973_80BB_4b43_88D8_929B99D96AB3' name='PartStructure'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691068297219_884586_1675' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;PrimaryPartType &lt;/i&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;i&gt;PartStructure&lt;/i&gt;&amp;quot; has an inconsistency with VEC&amp;#160;conventions for historical reasons, which is kept for backwards compatibility. The corresponding &lt;i&gt;PartOrUsageRelatedSpecification&lt;/i&gt; is the &lt;i&gt;PartStructureSpecification. &lt;/i&gt;However, the corresponding &lt;i&gt;Role&lt;/i&gt; is the &lt;i&gt;PartWithSubComponentsRole&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_08FD4973_80BB_4b43_88D8_929B99D96AB3'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_512F49EE_EA31_4458_8A72_7F8983ED7D70' name='PluggableTerminal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481559294257_564208_3153' name='PotentialDistributor'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_7A679657_506D_4f4b_8580_B6E39DDBC771' name='Relay'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_4AC12384_3FCB_458c_BE01_B6243E132AE5' name='RingTerminal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_7DB64B24_C93B_4018_BE27_1B57646BD5BC' name='ShrinkableTube'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_BF85F5A7_4720_40ae_9F35_35269B94197D' name='SpliceTerminal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_D9722757_4243_4d2f_B85E_7DC2B0E812AB' name='Stripe'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_37DE4147_223B_4fd6_8662_F30B49AE9083' name='Tape'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_1D62B1B8_32EC_4ba0_81E5_760AF44B4DAB' name='Terminal'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1729263635109_321993_2159' name='TerminalProtection'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_3B8441BA_F8B3_4db3_82FE_0EE1476F0ED0' name='Tube'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_AEEDE930_3229_4f00_AA6C_298D820731AB' name='Wire'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481553264593_396709_2904' name='WireEndAccessory'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_5967E356_7EC0_4f34_A2F5_2C8BCD4177E6' name='WireProtection'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_9A4957E9_2C39_495e_9494_FA3C4638D3DE' name='RoutableElement' isAbstract='true'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9A4957E9_2C39_495e_9494_FA3C4638D3DEDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;A RoutableElement is an element that can be routed, which mean it is possible to assign it to a Path in the Topology. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9A4957E9_2C39_495e_9494_FA3C4638D3DE'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_77DD9F17_F160_43b8_BA49_19459F2F3BBD' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_D2981BF7_2899_4491_A699_D434817A0FC2'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_8433DA40_7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst33DA40_7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src33DA40_7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_8433DA40_7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329Documentation' body='Specifies the Element that is routed. &#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_8433DA40_7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src33DA40_7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329' visibility='public' type='EAID_D82EA93F_B330_4d26_9C4A_9DB4B173CDAC' association='EAID_8433DA40_7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000211__7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000212__7E88_4de1_BDCE_A3C06C95C329' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_BF3A3386_BA07_4b88_BF56_74D6B871F76F' name='SheetOrChapter'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_BF3A3386_BA07_4b88_BF56_74D6B871F76FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Documents can be structured into sheets or chapters. Since it is possible, that one document describes a couple of parts it is necessary to be able to specify which sheet or chapter contains the description of which part. (see KBLFRM-308)&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_BF3A3386_BA07_4b88_BF56_74D6B871F76F'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_FAFF8DAB_7E60_488d_8710_34AEA979F53B' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_8FF227CE_6229_4d8d_8F08_C3EB0620AF4C' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_8FF227CE_6229_4d8d_8F08_C3EB0620AF4CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The identification of the sheet or chapter within the document. This value must be distinct within the context of a document. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_8FF227CE_6229_4d8d_8F08_C3EB0620AF4C'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000213_6229_4d8d_8F08_C3EB0620AF4C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000214_6229_4d8d_8F08_C3EB0620AF4C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstE08FEA_9560_4894_92AD_8AB6C0D024EF' name='referencedPart' visibility='public' type='EAID_A784D820_0381_42ed_8168_0F1AE554D91B' association='EAID_06E08FEA_9560_4894_92AD_8AB6C0D024EF'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000215__9560_4894_92AD_8AB6C0D024EF'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000216__9560_4894_92AD_8AB6C0D024EF' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102659333_10441_2643' name='specification' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29F' association='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102659333_873069_2642'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102671380_690159_2671'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102671380_85439_2672' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102992947_319436_3147' name='sheetNumber' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1444985739539_171709_2882' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The sheetNumber is the major identifier of a SheetOrChapter. The format is user defined and respectively company specific. This field has to be used if a SheetOrChapter has its own &amp;quot;DocumentNumber&amp;quot;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102992947_319436_3147'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434103008291_204107_3151'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434103008291_741383_3152' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102900071_643322_3106' name='changeDescription' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_F4242FED_CDA4_496a_80E8_F922CE497D97' association='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102900071_785352_3105'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102907087_414872_3129'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102907087_904126_3130' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434103016479_568562_3153' name='sheetVersion' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1444985830925_467758_2883' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The sheetVersion specifies the version index of a sheet (see also sheetNumber)&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434103016479_568562_3153'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434103038792_166934_3157'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434103038792_929393_3158' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102733881_611918_2948' name='description' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382703731024_96357_2253'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1444985863759_795450_2884' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Room for additional, human readable information about the SheetOrChapter.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102733881_611918_2948'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102752944_678292_2951'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102752944_579363_2952' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102948275_191972_3141' name='sheetFormat' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1444985880514_105215_2885' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the format&amp;#160;of the SheetOrChapter. This is an alias for a specific sheet /&amp;#160;paper size (e.g. DINA4). If both attributes are defined the &lt;i&gt;SheetSize&lt;/i&gt; takes precedence.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102948275_191972_3141'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102971728_73704_3145'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1434102971728_75806_3146' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637075168534_645645_5470' name='sheetSize' visibility='public' type='EAID_B1908A48_B6CF_477c_8CA7_E6AA9A584B07'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637075205459_954393_5474' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;Defines the size of the sheet with numerical values. This is the size of the &amp;quot;paper&amp;quot;, the actual drawing area might be smaller for example due to drawing frames.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1637075168534_645645_5470'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637075192978_144316_5472'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637075192978_923768_5473' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_06DCB3D9_2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstDCB3D9_2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcDCB3D9_2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_06DCB3D9_2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43Documentation' body='References the SheetOrChapter that is used as an Instruction.&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_06DCB3D9_2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcDCB3D9_2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43' visibility='public' type='EAID_57624064_55AE_43fb_840C_ACDDA2ABE43A' association='EAID_06DCB3D9_2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000217__2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000218__2D7F_4886_821F_6C4E08AACD43' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29F' name='Specification' isAbstract='true'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Abstract super-class for all specifications. Every technical information exchanged with the VEC is contained in the different specializations of a specification.  &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29F'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_EAC458F1_FB0F_4fcb_BD96_658451FEDA2C' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_855459C1_85B5_4a21_B240_33AB9E8845B9' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_855459C1_85B5_4a21_B240_33AB9E8845B9Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a unique identification of the specification. The identification is guaranteed to be unique within the document containing the specification. For all VEC-documents a Specification-instance can be trusted to be identical if the DocumentVersion-instance is the same (see DocumentVersion) and the identification of the Specification is the same.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_855459C1_85B5_4a21_B240_33AB9E8845B9'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000223_85B5_4a21_B240_33AB9E8845B9' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1659532895783_608193_5921' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_09122FB6_B233_445f_AF2F_A2117E118BFD' name='description' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382703731024_96357_2253'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_09122FB6_B233_445f_AF2F_A2117E118BFDDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies additional, human readable information about the specification.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_09122FB6_B233_445f_AF2F_A2117E118BFD'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000225_B233_445f_AF2F_A2117E118BFD'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000226_B233_445f_AF2F_A2117E118BFD' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_3295EA5F_664B_4c33_B427_B10B02F14455' name='VecContent'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3295EA5F_664B_4c33_B427_B10B02F14455Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The VecContent is the XML-Root node for any VEC-Document.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;Note about&lt;i&gt; &lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;GeneratingSystemName&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;GeneratingSystemVersion:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt; Both together are intended to provide meta information to identify the generating system and its version for reasons of traceability (system is used as general term and can also be a system landscape, a highly modularized micro service architecture or a tool chain). It is not intended to provided detailed information about the composition or&amp;#160;configuration of a system and its modules. Especially in a scenario where a system is highly modularized (e.g. a micro service architecture) any detailed information would be subject to very individual interpretation.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Therefore, the VEC&amp;#160;provides only the means to &lt;u&gt;identify&lt;/u&gt; a specific system configuration, &lt;u&gt;not to describe&lt;/u&gt; it. The &lt;i&gt;GeneratingSystemName&lt;/i&gt; allows identification in space (who did it), and the &lt;i&gt;GeneratingSystemVersion&lt;/i&gt; provides identification in time (when was it done, with which version of the configuration). The generator of the dataset is responsible to provide meaningful identifications for both, that satisfy the traceability requirements in the context.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The following scenarios are explicitly allowed:&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;ol&gt;&#10;      &lt;li&gt;&#10;Single System: Single identifiers are used which are mapping directly to a system /&amp;#160;system version (e.g. &amp;quot;Component DB&amp;quot; /&amp;#160;&amp;quot;V7.1.0&amp;quot;)&#10;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#10;      &lt;li&gt;&#10;Combined System: The identifiers are a combination of the participating modules (e.g. &amp;quot;Design System X+Userware&amp;#160;ACME+DBExport&amp;quot; /&amp;#160;&amp;quot;V3+V2.7+V1.2.3&amp;quot;).&#10;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#10;      &lt;li&gt;&#10;Baseline&amp;#160;/&amp;#160;System Configuration: The identifiers are pointing to a baseline in the configuration management of a system landscape. The systems and their versions are tracked there, outside the VEC (e.g. &amp;quot;Harness Tool&amp;#160;Chain&amp;quot; / &amp;quot;V12-2023-5&amp;quot;).&#10;&#10;      &lt;/li&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ol&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3295EA5F_664B_4c33_B427_B10B02F14455'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_0B80FF6C_3BF4_4315_A5C4_F8B2072355E6' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_3CDED346_5490_4882_9BDA_9D52C25B2E93' name='vecVersion' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1417710611511_14069_2540'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3CDED346_5490_4882_9BDA_9D52C25B2E93Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the version of the VEC used for the file.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3CDED346_5490_4882_9BDA_9D52C25B2E93'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000229_5490_4882_9BDA_9D52C25B2E93' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000230_5490_4882_9BDA_9D52C25B2E93' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_6FBD4088_2A63_4c77_93F7_C44409394072' name='generatingSystemName' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6FBD4088_2A63_4c77_93F7_C44409394072Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the name of the system that has generated the VEC-file (see note in class documentation).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6FBD4088_2A63_4c77_93F7_C44409394072'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000231_2A63_4c77_93F7_C44409394072'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000232_2A63_4c77_93F7_C44409394072' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_3744C1AC_3985_493f_A956_47EB8EAFBF69' name='dateOfCreation' visibility='public' type='EAJava_Date'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3744C1AC_3985_493f_A956_47EB8EAFBF69Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the date of creation of the VEC-file. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3744C1AC_3985_493f_A956_47EB8EAFBF69'/>
