						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_90D24473_91AB_48f7_88BA_F924DF0DBC62'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcD24473_91AB_48f7_88BA_F924DF0DBC62' visibility='public' type='EAID_FFF01D9D_C445_4f17_BA49_ED1A7E4EA42B' association='EAID_90D24473_91AB_48f7_88BA_F924DF0DBC62'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000655__91AB_48f7_88BA_F924DF0DBC62'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000656__91AB_48f7_88BA_F924DF0DBC62' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_A632D277_1F80_40e0_83B7_2FDEC62DAA16' name='TerminalType'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_A632D277_1F80_40e0_83B7_2FDEC62DAA16Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the type (system) of a terminal. The type is specified by a combination of a name for the system and an optional nominalSize.&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;In some processes the terminal type is referred as cavity system, because the system of cavities, terminals, seals, plugs and other cavity accessories must match&amp;#160;/&amp;#160;be compatible.&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;However, since a terminal has only one since type and a cavity can be compatible to more than one it is named &lt;i&gt;TerminalType&lt;/i&gt; in the VEC.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_A632D277_1F80_40e0_83B7_2FDEC62DAA16'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_B974A9C9_A20A_43e5_A6D9_E0C69C6AB91B' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_06F77294_4107_4d93_B9D9_E7136BD5F538' name='name' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_06F77294_4107_4d93_B9D9_E7136BD5F538Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the type of the cavity (e.g. MQS, DFK, ...).&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_06F77294_4107_4d93_B9D9_E7136BD5F538'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000659_4107_4d93_B9D9_E7136BD5F538' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000660_4107_4d93_B9D9_E7136BD5F538' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_0C05B36C_8F14_4c6b_87DE_D9CAD9BDB404' name='nominalSize' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_0C05B36C_8F14_4c6b_87DE_D9CAD9BDB404Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the nominal size of terminals that fit into the cavity. (e.g. 2x4). &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_0C05B36C_8F14_4c6b_87DE_D9CAD9BDB404'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000661_8F14_4c6b_87DE_D9CAD9BDB404'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000662_8F14_4c6b_87DE_D9CAD9BDB404' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_B96A595D_1A89_45c6_B78D_5D307E761194' name='WireElement'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1384771669076_59708_2741' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;WireElement &lt;/i&gt;specifies a &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification&lt;/i&gt; in the context of a &lt;i&gt;WireSpecification&lt;/i&gt;. This is necessary to define a unique &lt;i&gt;identification&lt;/i&gt; of a &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification &lt;/i&gt;in the context of a &lt;i&gt;WireSpecification. &lt;/i&gt;Additionally, the &lt;i&gt;WireElement&lt;/i&gt; serves as anchor for the instancing of a wire (&lt;i&gt;WireElementReference&lt;/i&gt;) as the &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecifications &lt;/i&gt;are not uniquely related to a &lt;i&gt;WireSpecification&lt;/i&gt; for reasons of reusability.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B96A595D_1A89_45c6_B78D_5D307E761194'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_C74691C2_D6AD_43e6_8764_D511495A683F' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_E8CE384B_7CCC_4311_AB17_C69A06641DC3' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_E8CE384B_7CCC_4311_AB17_C69A06641DC3Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The identification of the WireElement. The identification is guaranteed to be unique within a wire and immutable. The identification is guaranteed to be the same for the same WireElement over different VEC documents.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_E8CE384B_7CCC_4311_AB17_C69A06641DC3'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000665_7CCC_4311_AB17_C69A06641DC3' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000666_7CCC_4311_AB17_C69A06641DC3' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4' name='wireElementSpecification' visibility='public' type='EAID_6391ADC0_2FF5_43d5_8C0D_FEFA1B61062B' association='EAID_8E04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000667__7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000668__7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1569924573748_315845_10822' name='subWireElement' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_B96A595D_1A89_45c6_B78D_5D307E761194' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1569924573748_144440_10821'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1569924592713_334097_10844'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1569924592714_162403_10845' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734536969314_586486_1990' name='index' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698667677_845864_2388'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734537853688_321440_2048' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;index&lt;/i&gt; defines an order on the &lt;i&gt;WireElements&lt;/i&gt; that are &lt;i&gt;SubWireElements&lt;/i&gt; of the same &lt;i&gt;WireElement &lt;/i&gt;and that are on the same &lt;i&gt;layer. &lt;/i&gt;If defined for an individual &lt;i&gt;WireElement&lt;/i&gt;, the &lt;i&gt;index&lt;/i&gt; shall be defined for all &lt;i&gt;SubWireElements&lt;/i&gt; within the same &lt;i&gt;WireElement&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;. &lt;/i&gt;The order defined for a specific wire can be interpreted either clockwise or counterclockwise, or from left to right and vice versa, depending on the respective direction of view.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1734536969314_586486_1990'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734536997792_852601_1992'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734536997792_441653_1993' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734537001304_533142_1994' name='layer' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698667677_845864_2388'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734538565154_981575_2099' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;The layer defines the layering of &lt;i&gt;WireElements&lt;/i&gt; that are &lt;i&gt;subWireElements&lt;/i&gt; of the same &lt;i&gt;WireElement&lt;/i&gt;. &lt;i&gt;WireElements&lt;/i&gt; with lower &lt;i&gt;layer&lt;/i&gt; values are positioned further inward. If defined for an individual &lt;i&gt;WireElement&lt;/i&gt;, the &lt;i&gt;layer&lt;/i&gt; shall be defined for all &lt;i&gt;SubWireElements&lt;/i&gt; within the same &lt;i&gt;WireElement&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1734537001304_533142_1994'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734537020689_141467_1996'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734537020690_983676_1997' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_8E04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_8E04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Reference the &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification &lt;/i&gt;that is represented by the &lt;i&gt;WireElement.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_8E04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4' visibility='public' type='EAID_B96A595D_1A89_45c6_B78D_5D307E761194' association='EAID_8E04AA4D_7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000699__7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000700__7AB5_4398_A90D_B4F4C8F6A4D4' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_85C472FC_3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstC472FC_3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcC472FC_3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_85C472FC_3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the &lt;i&gt;WireElement&lt;/i&gt; that represents the root of the &lt;i&gt;WireSpecification&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_85C472FC_3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcC472FC_3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730' visibility='public' type='EAID_CE3C9D13_8E62_4ef8_A553_37D7F6E1CA0C' association='EAID_85C472FC_3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000669__3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000670__3250_421d_9064_6E9CD90CD730' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_879BF440_CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst9BF440_CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src9BF440_CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_879BF440_CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the WireElement that is represented by the WireElementReference.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_879BF440_CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src9BF440_CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4' visibility='public' type='EAID_D461D8CC_28EC_41c5_82DE_148EA9C7C468' association='EAID_879BF440_CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000671__CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000672__CC49_421a_BFD9_322A279791D4' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_6391ADC0_2FF5_43d5_8C0D_FEFA1B61062B' name='WireElementSpecification'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6391ADC0_2FF5_43d5_8C0D_FEFA1B61062BDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A WireElementSpecification is the basic element to describe a wire in the VEC. A WireElementSpecification can be atomic or composed recursively out of other WireElementSpecifications. A WireElementSpecification can reference an InsulationSpecification, if it has an insulation, a CoreSpecification, if it has a core or a WireGroupSpecification if it is a grouping of other WireElementSpecifications in the Wire (e.g. a multi-core wire with twisted pairs).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6391ADC0_2FF5_43d5_8C0D_FEFA1B61062B'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_7AAEDE1B_661F_45f9_88CD_5E6B82921A25' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29F'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_9BE340AF_67FA_4618_9F93_FF529BDBC1CF' name='type' visibility='public' type='EAID_ACBE4C96_FE6E_46d2_96BB_0E9237996505'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9BE340AF_67FA_4618_9F93_FF529BDBC1CFDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the type of the wire. A wire must not have more than one type. This attribute allows more than one value for the reason, that the same type can be expressed in multiple reference systems.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9BE340AF_67FA_4618_9F93_FF529BDBC1CF'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000673_67FA_4618_9F93_FF529BDBC1CF'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000674_67FA_4618_9F93_FF529BDBC1CF' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_BB51D9F8_7673_412a_9D33_A9BAC38F70EB' name='minBendRadiusDynamic' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_BB51D9F8_7673_412a_9D33_A9BAC38F70EBDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the minimum bend radius for wire element, if it is used in a dynamic environment, where it is bended repeatedly (e.g. in grommet of the back door). (see KLBFRM-311)&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_BB51D9F8_7673_412a_9D33_A9BAC38F70EB'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000675_7673_412a_9D33_A9BAC38F70EB'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000676_7673_412a_9D33_A9BAC38F70EB' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_4595BF1E_A149_4cec_94B6_9752801D293F' name='minBendRadiusStatic' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_4595BF1E_A149_4cec_94B6_9752801D293FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the minimum bend radius for wire element, if it is used in a static environment, where it is bended once during installation. After that it remains unchanged in its bended position during usage. &#10;(see KLBFRM-311)&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_4595BF1E_A149_4cec_94B6_9752801D293F'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000677_A149_4cec_94B6_9752801D293F'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000678_A149_4cec_94B6_9752801D293F' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_5649B809_A012_4350_A9B1_43E976C42A0C' name='outsideDiameter' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_5649B809_A012_4350_A9B1_43E976C42A0CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the outside diameter of the WireElement. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_5649B809_A012_4350_A9B1_43E976C42A0C'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000679_A012_4350_A9B1_43E976C42A0C'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000680_A012_4350_A9B1_43E976C42A0C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_9A3E4801_AF21_4bb0_8C38_3DE631C82379' name='suitedForDynamicUse' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698654806_5864_2387'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9A3E4801_AF21_4bb0_8C38_3DE631C82379Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies if it is allowed to use the WireElement in a dynamic environment. &#10;(see KBLFRM-311)&#10;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9A3E4801_AF21_4bb0_8C38_3DE631C82379'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000681_AF21_4bb0_8C38_3DE631C82379'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000682_AF21_4bb0_8C38_3DE631C82379' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_9058E4B7_47DF_40db_8864_66B80B355F4C' name='impedance' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9058E4B7_47DF_40db_8864_66B80B355F4CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Defines the impedance of this wireElement. Typically used for WireElements that have subWireElements e.g. twisted pair or coax wires.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9058E4B7_47DF_40db_8864_66B80B355F4C'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000683_47DF_40db_8864_66B80B355F4C'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000684_47DF_40db_8864_66B80B355F4C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_A27FCD0C_3FE4_4820_901E_D7F43A5B0875' name='size' visibility='public' type='EAID_B1908A48_B6CF_477c_8CA7_E6AA9A584B07'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_A27FCD0C_3FE4_4820_901E_D7F43A5B0875Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the size of a WireElement if it has not the shape of circle. If it has the shape of a circle the size is normally defined by its outside diameter.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_A27FCD0C_3FE4_4820_901E_D7F43A5B0875'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000685_3FE4_4820_901E_D7F43A5B0875'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000686_3FE4_4820_901E_D7F43A5B0875' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstE6C616_6121_4999_8085_7C74268A546E' name='fillerSpecification' visibility='public' type='EAID_C1175F23_262C_4386_85A2_130E968F365E' association='EAID_16E6C616_6121_4999_8085_7C74268A546E'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000687__6121_4999_8085_7C74268A546E'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000688__6121_4999_8085_7C74268A546E' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst34B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47' name='wireGroupSpecification' visibility='public' type='EAID_6528301E_F639_4d76_8051_8DA894BC8329' association='EAID_4234B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000689__EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000690__EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst8DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9' name='subWireElementSpecification' visibility='public' isUnique='false' type='EAID_6391ADC0_2FF5_43d5_8C0D_FEFA1B61062B' association='EAID_578DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000691__F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000692__F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst65A1CD_F893_49a9_BA3A_880201E4DD3E' name='conductorSpecification' visibility='public' type='EAID_58B1BEDB_9393_4275_87CB_E943E3F5D823' association='EAID_BA65A1CD_F893_49a9_BA3A_880201E4DD3E'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000693__F893_49a9_BA3A_880201E4DD3E'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000694__F893_49a9_BA3A_880201E4DD3E' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstC24B3D_ED64_4183_B13E_D00CD9208676' name='insulationSpecification' visibility='public' type='EAID_9132061B_4CC3_4b54_BF57_9A46912CCF77' association='EAID_E5C24B3D_ED64_4183_B13E_D00CD9208676'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000695__ED64_4183_B13E_D00CD9208676'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000696__ED64_4183_B13E_D00CD9208676' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481191548644_694126_3712' name='validWireReceptionTypes' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481118863653_216817_3517'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481191587273_464204_3717' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the &lt;i&gt;WireReceptionTypes&lt;/i&gt; that are allowed for joining with the specified &lt;i&gt;WireElement.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481191548644_694126_3712'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481191571392_49209_3715'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481191571393_988431_3716' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481280611560_323989_3194' name='gridSpacing' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481280632805_780022_3198' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the grid spacing. The grid spacing is the distance between the centres of two adjacent sub wire elements.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;This attribute is only valid for &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecifications &lt;/i&gt;that have &lt;i&gt;SubWireElementSpecifications.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481280611560_323989_3194'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481280628135_611474_3196'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481280628135_353214_3197' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481281707912_790152_3261' name='shape' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481281630655_738921_3235'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481281741179_938492_3265' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the shape of a &lt;i&gt;WireElement. &lt;/i&gt;Circular wire elements are defined by their outsideDiameter, all others are defined by their size.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481281707912_790152_3261'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481281734456_281242_3263'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481281734456_388223_3264' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1633615246039_11249_5676' name='transmissionMediumType' visibility='public' type='_19_0_2_854026d_1633617440598_736151_5681'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1633617510045_715191_5701' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;Defines the transmission medium in this wire element.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1633615246039_11249_5676'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1633615273523_241980_5678'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1633615273523_269310_5679' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_4234B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst34B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src34B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_4234B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;If the &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification&lt;/i&gt; is representing a wire group, then the specification of the wire group is referenced here. That means as well, that the &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification&lt;/i&gt; shall have &lt;i&gt;subWireElementSpecifications&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_4234B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src34B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47' visibility='public' type='EAID_6391ADC0_2FF5_43d5_8C0D_FEFA1B61062B' association='EAID_4234B410_EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000707__EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000708__EB1C_4c21_9778_43A9CBABCD47' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_578DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst8DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src8DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_578DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the contained subWireElements if the WireElement has sub elements. If a &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification &lt;/i&gt;contains the same &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification &lt;/i&gt;multiple times, then it shall be referenced as often as it occurs in the reality. Otherwise the &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification &lt;/i&gt;wouldn&#39;t specify a wire element unambiguously, because the representation in the model would be the same, regardless of the number of sub elements. Therefore, this association must not be realized with a &amp;quot;set&amp;quot; semantic.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_578DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src8DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9' visibility='public' type='EAID_6391ADC0_2FF5_43d5_8C0D_FEFA1B61062B' association='EAID_578DC2A2_F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000697__F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000698__F028_4c91_BE8C_D27763575DF9' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_AB78EDCD_E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3A'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst78EDCD_E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3A'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src78EDCD_E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3A'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_AB78EDCD_E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the &lt;i&gt;WireElementSpecification &lt;/i&gt;that defines the properties of the top-most &lt;i&gt;WireElement.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_AB78EDCD_E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3A'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src78EDCD_E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3A' visibility='public' type='EAID_CE3C9D13_8E62_4ef8_A553_37D7F6E1CA0C' association='EAID_AB78EDCD_E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3A'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000701__E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3A'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000702__E254_4e46_A58A_A2B1C8862B3A' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_6528301E_F639_4d76_8051_8DA894BC8329' name='WireGroupSpecification'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6528301E_F639_4d76_8051_8DA894BC8329Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specification for the definition of WireGroups. Wire groups are for example used for the representation of twisted pairs.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6528301E_F639_4d76_8051_8DA894BC8329'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_26751E8E_40DE_498a_9A27_A65D46B09197' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29F'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_3616DCA7_D3BE_4452_8987_D00797FED5DB' name='groupType' visibility='public' type='_19_0_2_854026d_1637077908808_781598_5580'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3616DCA7_D3BE_4452_8987_D00797FED5DBDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the type of the group (e.g. twisted pair, ...).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3616DCA7_D3BE_4452_8987_D00797FED5DB'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000703_D3BE_4452_8987_D00797FED5DB' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637077984669_567691_5600' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_FFAA164F_BCF0_4aa1_B831_3C302D468BF3' name='lengthOfTwist' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_FFAA164F_BCF0_4aa1_B831_3C302D468BF3Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the length of twist if the wire group is representing a twisted pair. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_FFAA164F_BCF0_4aa1_B831_3C302D468BF3'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000705_BCF0_4aa1_B831_3C302D468BF3'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000706_BCF0_4aa1_B831_3C302D468BF3' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_9CF2F06E_1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstF2F06E_1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcF2F06E_1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9CF2F06E_1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the &lt;i&gt;WireGroupSpecification&lt;/i&gt; that applies to the &lt;i&gt;WireGrouping&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9CF2F06E_1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcF2F06E_1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91' visibility='public' type='EAID_6B9233F7_B7DB_436c_84CF_8C46FCF122D6' association='EAID_9CF2F06E_1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000709__1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000710__1DAC_49b9_A0B3_03E499FB2E91' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_8FAC45EE_C74E_430c_BEC6_44F16C3C3104' name='WireReception'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_8FAC45EE_C74E_430c_BEC6_44F16C3C3104Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A WireReception is the area of a terminal where the contacting with a wire element (e.g. by crimping) takes place. This class represents such an area on the terminal. Its description is done with a WireReceptionSpecification, which is independent from the TerminalSpecification. This allows the reuse of the specification of similar WireReception on different terminals.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_8FAC45EE_C74E_430c_BEC6_44F16C3C3104'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_A1748750_C346_4580_B75C_6A980A80F081' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_A12E3D9E_6FFF_40af_AEE7_35D0C09930E3' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_A12E3D9E_6FFF_40af_AEE7_35D0C09930E3Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a unique identification of the WireReception. The identification is guaranteed to be unique within the TerminalSpecification (this might be for example a reception number).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_A12E3D9E_6FFF_40af_AEE7_35D0C09930E3'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000711_6FFF_40af_AEE7_35D0C09930E3' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000712_6FFF_40af_AEE7_35D0C09930E3' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstB4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8' name='wireReceptionSpecification' visibility='public' type='EAID_667A59DB_C6EB_417d_B96F_9F12C28DC687' association='EAID_34B4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000713__5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000714__5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D' name='placementPoint' visibility='public' type='EAID_1C710815_9E4A_4f20_A982_B2B4373EC80C' association='EAID_EDF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000715__1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000716__1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_50DB2BF4_0F05_451f_ACB2_5E8B67DE865A' name='angle' visibility='public' isOrdered='true' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_50DB2BF4_0F05_451f_ACB2_5E8B67DE865ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the angles against two planes of the connector housing a wire reception can be buckled. The planes are defined in a way, that angles of &amp;#160;[0.0, 0.0] specify an unbuckled (regular)&amp;#160;terminal. The two planes are perpendicular to each other and parallel to the plugging direction of the terminal (the direction of the pin).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The plane for the first angle is the plane in which the uncrimped wire reception would be, if the terminal has not been buckled. Since most terminals are cut or punched in some way out of a sheet of metal, this plane would be the same as metal sheet before further deformation.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;For ring terminals the first plane is perpendicular to the bolt direction.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;With a viewing direction from the wire reception to the terminal reception and the intended wire position above the terminal, buckling directions up and right are expressed by positive angles, down and left by negative angles.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_50DB2BF4_0F05_451f_ACB2_5E8B67DE865A'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000639_0F05_451f_ACB2_5E8B67DE865A'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000640_0F05_451f_ACB2_5E8B67DE865A' value='2'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1700134737195_351090_2218' name='rotation' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1700134759674_889787_2222' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the rotation of a &lt;i&gt;WireReception&lt;/i&gt; relative to the &lt;i&gt;TerminalReception. &lt;/i&gt;The rotation of the &lt;i&gt;WireReception&lt;/i&gt; is the angle between the normal vector on base plane of the crimp area and the y-axis, which is a rotation around the z-axis (right hand rule, compare illustration in &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;Terminal Coordinate&amp;#160;System&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt;).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1700134737195_351090_2218'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1700134751975_876215_2220'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1700134751976_852570_2221' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_34B4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstB4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcB4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_34B4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8Documentation' body='References the WireReceptionSpecification that specifies the WireReception. &#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_34B4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcB4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8' visibility='public' type='EAID_8FAC45EE_C74E_430c_BEC6_44F16C3C3104' association='EAID_34B4B451_5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000737__5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000738__5814_4d4c_9C67_806B9E4997E8' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_EDF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_EDF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the &lt;i&gt;PlacementPoint&lt;/i&gt; that represents this &lt;i&gt;WireReception&lt;/i&gt; in a PlaceableElementSpecification.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_EDF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D' visibility='public' type='EAID_8FAC45EE_C74E_430c_BEC6_44F16C3C3104' association='EAID_EDF89FC4_1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001727__1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001728__1603_47c3_8F15_733599B7F35D' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_BA895259_06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst895259_06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src895259_06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_BA895259_06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;References the &lt;i&gt;WireReception&lt;/i&gt; that is instanced by this &lt;i&gt;WireReceptionReference.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_BA895259_06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src895259_06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5' visibility='public' type='EAID_EA68DAC2_F465_4d3e_9580_B7E2E595B2B8' association='EAID_BA895259_06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000719__06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000720__06D2_4d1c_BF27_1AE6251E15B5' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_667A59DB_C6EB_417d_B96F_9F12C28DC687' name='WireReceptionSpecification'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_667A59DB_C6EB_417d_B96F_9F12C28DC687Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specification for the definition of wire receptions. A WireReception is the area of a terminal where the contacting with a wire element (e.g. by crimping) takes place.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_667A59DB_C6EB_417d_B96F_9F12C28DC687'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_5FDC7380_A5B8_4aed_B287_9ACA0782BCB1' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29F'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_96040A34_7859_48d4_BD47_035D1571CEFD' name='coreCrossSectionArea' visibility='public' type='EAID_CAF23CB7_00D0_48de_9B42_ADB340B9B4A8'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_96040A34_7859_48d4_BD47_035D1571CEFDDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a value range for cross-section areas of cores that are compatible with the wire reception.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;For wire receptions where a single core is attached to, this value defines the &lt;i&gt;ValueRange&lt;/i&gt; of the &lt;i&gt;crossSectionArea &lt;/i&gt;of the core. For wire receptions where more than one core is attached to (e.g. ring terminals, splices), this attribute defines the valid value range for the sum of the cross-section areas of all attached cores.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_96040A34_7859_48d4_BD47_035D1571CEFD'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000723_7859_48d4_BD47_035D1571CEFD'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000724_7859_48d4_BD47_035D1571CEFD' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_34C993B6_BC27_4ef1_898A_AED3D77E527D' name='insulationDisplacementLength' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_34C993B6_BC27_4ef1_898A_AED3D77E527DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the length of the insulation which must be stripped off to fit to this wire reception. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_34C993B6_BC27_4ef1_898A_AED3D77E527D'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000725_BC27_4ef1_898A_AED3D77E527D'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000726_BC27_4ef1_898A_AED3D77E527D' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_7565EA22_64D6_4be5_8C74_2ACADD62F3D5' name='multiContact' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698654806_5864_2387'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_7565EA22_64D6_4be5_8C74_2ACADD62F3D5Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies if it is possible to contact more than one core at the wire reception. If this attribute is set to true, the wire reception is allowed for more than one wire, but one wire is possible as well. If set to false, only one wire is allowed.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_7565EA22_64D6_4be5_8C74_2ACADD62F3D5'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000727_64D6_4be5_8C74_2ACADD62F3D5'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000728_64D6_4be5_8C74_2ACADD62F3D5' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_3BA6E749_E356_4843_8028_BAF54917B7BE' name='wireReceptionType' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481118863653_216817_3517'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3BA6E749_E356_4843_8028_BAF54917B7BEDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the type of the wire reception. The &lt;i&gt;WireReceptionType&lt;/i&gt; defines how the wire is joined with the wire reception.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;This attribute is defined in an OpenEnumeration. As there are terminals that support multiple joining techniques, e.g. crimping, soldering and a combination of both, it is possible to define multiple values for this attribute.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Joining methods that are a combination of other joining methods are represented as a separate literal. For example a &lt;i&gt;WireReceptionSpecification &lt;/i&gt;with&lt;i&gt; WireReceptionType = [Crimp,Soldering]&lt;/i&gt; supports crimping &lt;u&gt;or&lt;/u&gt; soldering, but not a combination of both, where as the definition &lt;i&gt;[Crimp,CrimpAndSoldering]&lt;/i&gt; would support crimping and crimping with subsequent soldering, but not soldering alone.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3BA6E749_E356_4843_8028_BAF54917B7BE'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000729_E356_4843_8028_BAF54917B7BE'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1728544052271_452233_2577' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_CF3B59A5_A347_4914_9EF4_3994CE779B47' name='wireElementOutsideDiameter' visibility='public' type='EAID_CAF23CB7_00D0_48de_9B42_ADB340B9B4A8'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_CF3B59A5_A347_4914_9EF4_3994CE779B47Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a value range for valid diameters a WireElement must have to fit to the wire reception.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_CF3B59A5_A347_4914_9EF4_3994CE779B47'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000731_A347_4914_9EF4_3994CE779B47'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000732_A347_4914_9EF4_3994CE779B47' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_8EDAD54F_B3BF_41d5_80E5_8AF55F7C0303' name='platingMaterial' visibility='public' type='EAID_349A4B4C_CCF4_4206_8013_AD19345723A4'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_8EDAD54F_B3BF_41d5_80E5_8AF55F7C0303Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the plating material of the wire reception.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_8EDAD54F_B3BF_41d5_80E5_8AF55F7C0303'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI000733_B3BF_41d5_80E5_8AF55F7C0303'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI000734_B3BF_41d5_80E5_8AF55F7C0303' value='*'/>
