							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939417379_52644_7395' name='PowerConsumptionType'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939447040_825429_7415' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;OpenEnumeration for predefined &lt;i&gt;PowerConsumptionTypes.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939417379_52644_7395'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939480357_359857_7416' name='Typical'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939488003_98870_7418' name='Standby'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939492717_930268_7420' name='Minimum'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939499068_758782_7422' name='Maximum'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939505421_183131_7424' name='Sleep'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939510379_234425_7426' name='DeepSleep'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637939515619_727092_7428' name='StartStop'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193012400_461598_5591' name='LabelingSpecification'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193039207_744220_5615' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;A component (of any type) can labeled in many ways either during the manufacturing process, for example a label that is imprinted on the component during the general manufacturing process&amp;#160;(e.g. the part number), or in its concrete use (e.g. with wire number or a usage node id). The &lt;i&gt;LabelingSpecification&lt;/i&gt; defines general labeling properties of the component. Labeling properties in its concrete use are defined with the correspoding role.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193012400_461598_5591'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193031058_120954_5614' general='EAID_6AB9AD42_9295_4771_B673_98FDF80C9A65'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133154_630923_5619' name='labelType' visibility='public' type='_19_0_2_854026d_1634218915438_445212_5461'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_810786_5630' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the type of a label printed, stamped or integrated on or in component (e.g. alpha numerical, bar code).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133154_630923_5619'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_561372_5631'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_514484_5629' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133154_630525_5618' name='labelValue' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_312407_5627' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the value of a label printed on the component. This value applies to all components that satisfy this specification, so all instances share the same label value (e.g. a part number).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;If instances of a component require individual labeling it has to be defined on the LabelingRole.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133154_630525_5618'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_585547_5628'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_797192_5626' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133152_790934_5616' name='labelingTechnology' visibility='public' type='_19_0_2_854026d_1634885611084_456946_5490'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_835521_5621' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;Specifies the used labeling technology if the label is already defined in this specification.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133152_790934_5616'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_447190_5622'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133154_447350_5620' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133154_967036_5617' name='allowedLabelingTechnology' visibility='public' type='_19_0_2_854026d_1634885611084_456946_5490'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_458646_5624' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;Specifies the allowed labeling technologies if the component is not yet labeled, but support labeling in its usage.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133154_967036_5617'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_309190_5625'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1638193133155_379410_5623' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1664783268746_635559_5564' name='TerminalReceptionGender'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1664783420649_917003_5584' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;&lt;i&gt;OpenEnumeration&lt;/i&gt; of possible genders for &lt;i&gt;TerminalReception&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1664783268746_635559_5564'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1664783494675_596381_5587' name='Female'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1664783490241_389938_5585' name='Male'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1664783498052_602936_5589' name='Unspecified'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069469819_13196_1865'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069469819_323454_1866'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069469819_662104_1867'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069672892_612712_1936' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;A terminal can have minimum distance requirements to other elements in the harness. Theses are defined with the &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceInformation.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069469819_13196_1865'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069469819_662104_1867' visibility='private' type='EAID_5D9F928A_6E6D_4895_A1B1_1FE6E28AAC51' association='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069469819_13196_1865'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069514990_640221_1900'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069514991_817243_1901' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069469800_553892_1864' name='TerminalDistanceInformation'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069817926_802987_1995' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Allows the definition of valid minimum distances for a terminal. A minimum distance is always a &lt;i&gt;NumericalValue&lt;/i&gt; defined for a &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceType&lt;/i&gt;. Attributes of the type &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceInformation&lt;/i&gt; normally have the multiplicity [0..*]. This means that such an attribute can have &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceInformation&lt;/i&gt; entries for different &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceType&lt;/i&gt;. It must not have multiple entries for the same &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceType&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069469800_553892_1864'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069559797_330874_1906' name='type' visibility='public' type='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069578584_533718_1913'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069955990_121297_2055' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;The type of the &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceInformation.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069559797_330874_1906'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069572392_470245_1910' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069572392_567185_1911' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069546982_628961_1904' name='value' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069939725_157278_2054' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;Defines the valid minimum distance.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069546982_628961_1904'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069568640_607916_1908' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069568640_137480_1909' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069578584_533718_1913' name='TerminalDistanceType'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069985694_787541_2114' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;i&gt;OpenEnumeration&lt;/i&gt; of possible &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceTypes&lt;/i&gt; for &lt;i&gt;TerminalDistanceInformation&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069578584_533718_1913'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069616128_477083_1932' name='Terminal'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691070032667_514947_2173' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The distance to the next terminal (e.g. for handling reasons).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069616128_477083_1932'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069638315_710502_1934' name='UltraSonicConnection'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1691070063756_692277_2232' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The distance to the next ultra-sonic-welding connection, e.g. a splice or a terminal (on the same wire).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1691069638315_710502_1934'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694181681364_727728_2079' name='HoleTerminalSpecification'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694181889931_966211_2103' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specification for the definition of hole terminals. These are used for example as attachment points of ring terminals at the car body.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694181681364_727728_2079'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694181760736_41521_2102' general='EAID_5D9F928A_6E6D_4895_A1B1_1FE6E28AAC51'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414480_732105_2104' name='holeDiameter' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414489_886777_2111' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the diameter of the hole in a numerical way.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414480_732105_2104'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414489_289810_2112'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414488_975954_2110' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414486_716964_2105' name='holeDepth' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414489_491539_2114' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;Specifies the depth of the hole.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414486_716964_2105'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414489_658047_2115'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414489_429_2113' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414487_121794_2106' name='holeNominalSize' visibility='public' type='_19_0_2_854026d_1633944896127_543014_5775'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414490_713524_2117' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the size (diameter) of the hole in a nominal way (e.g. &amp;quot;M8&amp;quot;).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414487_121794_2106'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414490_211156_2118'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414490_533396_2116' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414487_124720_2107' name='holeType' visibility='public' type='_19_0_2_854026d_1633935265410_533449_5739'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414490_308937_2120' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the type of the hole.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414487_124720_2107'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414490_625634_2121'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414490_727218_2119' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414487_324622_2108' name='torsionProtection' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698654806_5864_2387'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414491_781265_2123' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies if the hole provides torsion protected or not.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414487_324622_2108'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414491_103747_2124'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414491_90582_2122' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414488_17025_2109' name='maxTerminalCount' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698667677_845864_2388'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414491_782306_2126' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;Defines the maximum number of (ring) terminals that can be attached to this hole at the same time.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414488_17025_2109'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414491_731614_2127'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694182414491_813891_2125' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891095279_818910_2151' name='InsulationCrimpDetail'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695911835474_817234_3819' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;InsulationCrimpDetail&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt; &lt;/i&gt;defines crimp values for a insulation crimp. The selection criteria to which the &lt;i&gt;InsulationCrimpDetail&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt; &lt;/i&gt;applies are defined by the referenced &lt;i&gt;InsulationSpecification&lt;/i&gt; and the &lt;i&gt;ConductorSpecification&lt;/i&gt; referenced by the containing &lt;i&gt;CoreCrimpDetail.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891095279_818910_2151'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695903791006_880824_3388' general='_2022x_1_854026d_1695903695677_36608_3334'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891402890_566666_2291' name='appliesTo' visibility='public' type='EAID_9132061B_4CC3_4b54_BF57_9A46912CCF77' association='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891402890_845731_2290'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891426138_668597_2320' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891426138_980240_2321' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695912494870_285655_4031' name='pullOffForce' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695912559568_825829_4035' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The minimum force that the completed crimp should withstand when wire is being pulled off the terminal. Above that force, the crimp can be expected to be destroyed at any time. This values applies when core &amp;amp;&amp;#160;insulation crimp are functional.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1695912494870_285655_4031'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695912517565_786990_4033'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695912517565_83680_4034' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166798827_664548_2720' name='insulationPullOffForce' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166798829_429863_2722' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The minimum force that the completed crimp should withstand when wire is being pulled off the terminal. Above that force, the crimp can be expected to be destroyed at any time. This values applies when only the&amp;#160;insulation crimp is functional.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166798827_664548_2720'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166798829_546159_2723'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166798829_138154_2721' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891082734_125310_2129' name='CoreCrimpDetail'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695910898843_441128_3766' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;CoreCrimpDetail &lt;/i&gt;defines crimp values for a conductor crimp (wire crimp). The selection criteria to which the &lt;i&gt;CoreCrimpDetail &lt;/i&gt;applies are defined by the referenced &lt;i&gt;ConductorSpecification.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891082734_125310_2129'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695903783580_973198_3385' general='_2022x_1_854026d_1695903695677_36608_3334'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891141466_369086_2190' name='insulationCrimpDetails' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891095279_818910_2151' association='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891141466_341134_2189'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891153524_337237_2202'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891153525_449197_2203' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891414107_82058_2306' name='appliesTo' visibility='public' type='EAID_58B1BEDB_9393_4275_87CB_E943E3F5D823' association='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891414106_176801_2305'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891423570_190052_2316' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891423572_433546_2317' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166872952_360901_2837' name='corePullOffForce' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166872953_22922_2839' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The minimum force that the completed crimp should withstand when wire is being pulled off the terminal. Above that force, the crimp can be expected to be destroyed at any time. This values applies when only the&amp;#160;core crimp is present or functional (insulation crimp is either not present or disabled).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166872952_360901_2837'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166872954_990346_2840'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1750166872953_479998_2838' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891137181_690959_2176'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891137182_267399_2177'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891137182_953414_2178'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695910709241_461639_3712' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the &lt;i&gt;CrimpDetails&lt;/i&gt; for this WireReception.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891137181_690959_2176'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891137182_953414_2178' visibility='private' type='EAID_667A59DB_C6EB_417d_B96F_9F12C28DC687' association='_2022x_1_854026d_1695891137181_690959_2176'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
