				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734532880024_90823_1799' name='CrimpBarrelType'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734532941239_496042_1822' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The CrimpBarrel&lt;i&gt;Type&lt;/i&gt; defines in an &lt;i&gt;OpenEnumeration&lt;/i&gt; the shape of the crimp barrel in its unprocessed state. &#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1734532880024_90823_1799'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734532927962_573834_1818' name='Open'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734532933103_810318_1820' name='Closed'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734943793603_952521_1949' name='ReferenceSurfaceDefinition'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734944393218_339438_2058' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;A connector housing can define reference surfaces that serve as contact surfaces in a work piece holder. Those reference surfaces normally have defined tolerance limits to support accurate determination of cavity positions for example during the insertion process.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1734943793603_952521_1949'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734943924426_222956_1996' name='hasSurfaces' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698654806_5864_2387'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734943959686_113447_2000' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;Specifies whether the connector has defined references surfaces or not.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1734943924426_222956_1996'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734943949281_100363_1998' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734943949281_21163_1999' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734944104396_147729_2001' name='dimensionX' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1734944659934_986415_2107' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;Specifies the distance and tolerance between the middle axis of the lowest alpha numerical cavity (origin of the connector coordinate system) and the reference surface in direction of the X-axis.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1734944104396_147729_2001'/>
