					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_015BDED9_F023_443b_A162_C073D3459288' name='Rood'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_E5C2AA61_213F_44fc_9056_D54D0EDA96FB' name='Acre'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_C4E8A576_BF44_44be_992A_ED6604D2BB2C' name='MassInformation'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_C4E8A576_BF44_44be_992A_ED6604D2BB2CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Allows the definition of mass information. Attributes of the type MassInformation normally have the multiplicity [0..*]. This means that such an attribute can have mass values for different determinationTypes and valueSources. It must not have multiple values for the same determinationType and valueSource.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_C4E8A576_BF44_44be_992A_ED6604D2BB2C'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_04028800_F64A_4615_8101_1CEC020D1DE3' name='determinationType' visibility='public' type='EAID_87C860E0_5BCB_46d3_90AC_4E109661D5D6'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_04028800_F64A_4615_8101_1CEC020D1DE3Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the determination type of the mass information. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_04028800_F64A_4615_8101_1CEC020D1DE3'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001627_F64A_4615_8101_1CEC020D1DE3'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001628_F64A_4615_8101_1CEC020D1DE3' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_B41D2383_E439_4346_A4C3_CEE0917B964C' name='value' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B41D2383_E439_4346_A4C3_CEE0917B964CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the mass as numerical value. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B41D2383_E439_4346_A4C3_CEE0917B964C'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001629_E439_4346_A4C3_CEE0917B964C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001630_E439_4346_A4C3_CEE0917B964C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481188806351_725820_3579' name='valueSource' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481188821773_574731_3582'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481188879506_108977_3603' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;valueSource&lt;/i&gt; defines in an OpenEnumeration the source from which the &lt;i&gt;MassInformation&lt;/i&gt; has been retrieved. This information, in combination with the &lt;i&gt;ValueDetermination&lt;/i&gt; gives a hint about the reliability of the &lt;i&gt;MassInformation&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481188806351_725820_3579'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481188877338_526903_3601'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481188877338_639841_3602' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_349A4B4C_CCF4_4206_8013_AD19345723A4' name='Material'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_349A4B4C_CCF4_4206_8013_AD19345723A4Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Allows the definition of material information. Attributes of the type Material normally have the multiplicity [0..*]. This means that such an attribute can have material values for different &lt;i&gt;referenceSystems&lt;/i&gt;. It must not have multiple values for the same &lt;i&gt;referenceSystems&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_349A4B4C_CCF4_4206_8013_AD19345723A4'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_71715C0D_1E5A_404a_8812_43DCC8EE241A' name='key' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_71715C0D_1E5A_404a_8812_43DCC8EE241ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The key of the material in the corresponding material reference system.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_71715C0D_1E5A_404a_8812_43DCC8EE241A'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001633_1E5A_404a_8812_43DCC8EE241A' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001634_1E5A_404a_8812_43DCC8EE241A' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_B71E4FC7_CCFC_4b1d_B65A_6573D9307390' name='referenceSystem' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B71E4FC7_CCFC_4b1d_B65A_6573D9307390Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The identification of the material reference system, which is defining possible values and the semantic of material keys.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B71E4FC7_CCFC_4b1d_B65A_6573D9307390'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001635_CCFC_4b1d_B65A_6573D9307390' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001636_CCFC_4b1d_B65A_6573D9307390' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_3EA3CD44_7BF4_4406_8E19_433D35FCC903' name='description' visibility='public' type='EAID_6E33CD1B_63D7_4da8_BED4_828037944989'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3EA3CD44_7BF4_4406_8E19_433D35FCC903Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;On optional human readable description of the material (e.g. the name). &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3EA3CD44_7BF4_4406_8E19_433D35FCC903'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001637_7BF4_4406_8E19_433D35FCC903'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001638_7BF4_4406_8E19_433D35FCC903' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568' name='NumericalValue'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;A quantity expressed with a numerical value and a unit.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_AA9AA67F_C107_4338_A344_43D03AA35AFF' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_4E6FCE2B_DBD2_4b6b_BD65_C0AB3380EA4E'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_F09DCEDE_0B0F_4c75_AF42_4F821BE6487A' name='valueComponent' visibility='public' type='EAJava_double'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_F09DCEDE_0B0F_4c75_AF42_4F821BE6487ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the value of the numerical value.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F09DCEDE_0B0F_4c75_AF42_4F821BE6487A'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001639_0B0F_4c75_AF42_4F821BE6487A' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001640_0B0F_4c75_AF42_4F821BE6487A' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstC02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A' name='tolerance' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_7457DD90_7E8E_4045_9E17_882CA3FA1A36' association='EAID_56C02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001641__3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001642__3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_56C02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstC02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcC02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_56C02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the tolerance for the dimension.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_56C02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcC02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568' association='EAID_56C02180_3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001683__3096_4034_8E4B_AB699A994C6A'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1422888824744_604618_3041' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_DF025C3E_1ED9_44e9_91FF_1FBBC2CF2BAB' name='OtherUnit'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_DF025C3E_1ED9_44e9_91FF_1FBBC2CF2BABDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;The OtherUnit class can be used to define a unit, which is necessary in the context of data exchange but not contained in the standard systems (e.g. Piece). &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_DF025C3E_1ED9_44e9_91FF_1FBBC2CF2BAB'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_DC8EB05C_3E52_4449_8686_34F97C9498A4' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_E9E6E5D1_05CC_427c_9FD0_4C45AAAA1066'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_F3EC0A11_A89F_429b_AA44_820FEE3FBCF3' name='otherUnitName' visibility='public' type='EAID_978EB899_828F_48da_86B6_F4D035ED1CA3'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1385545651064_946390_2709' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the name of the unit.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F3EC0A11_A89F_429b_AA44_820FEE3FBCF3'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001643_A89F_429b_AA44_820FEE3FBCF3' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001644_A89F_429b_AA44_820FEE3FBCF3' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='EAID_978EB899_828F_48da_86B6_F4D035ED1CA3' name='OtherUnitName'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1385546077793_559990_2710' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Enumeration for the definition of other unit names.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_978EB899_828F_48da_86B6_F4D035ED1CA3'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_6841D644_AC86_4ed0_B141_63E28B66EC71' name='Pi'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_4E00CC45_A1AF_4ceb_BB4E_F5B028870A67' name='Piece'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179514871_781969_1695' name='ArcDegree'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179584183_911694_1701' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;ArcDegree is a unit of angle (1° = π/180 rad). This unit belongs to the special group of unit called &amp;quot;non-SI units that are accepted for use with the SI&amp;quot;.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179514871_781969_1695'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179528537_677414_1697' name='ArcMinute'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179874705_302663_1702' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;ArcMinute is a unit of angle (see ArcDegree).&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179528537_677414_1697'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179536286_162670_1699' name='ArcSecond'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179903983_463324_1703' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;ArcSecond is a unit of angle (see ArcDegree).&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1694179536286_162670_1699'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_EB5FB7F3_67F4_4812_A5C6_267D4CE8F6F7' name='RobustnessProperties'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_EB5FB7F3_67F4_4812_A5C6_267D4CE8F6F7Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Allows the definition of robustness properties. Robustness of a component is specified as a level of robustness against a specific influence (e.g. oil, water, UV-light). The influence is specified by the &lt;i&gt;class&lt;/i&gt; and the level is specified by the &lt;i&gt;classKey&lt;/i&gt;. Valid robustness classes and keys are specified by the reference system. Attributes of the type RobustnessProperties normally have the multiplicity [0..*]. This means that such an attribute can have RobustnessProperties entries for different &lt;i&gt;classReferenceSystems&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;classes&lt;/i&gt;. &#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Constraints for the multiplicity of entries for the same &lt;i&gt;class&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;classReferenceSystem&lt;/i&gt; are defined by the reference system. It most cases an element can have only one single value for a &lt;i&gt;class&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;classReferenceSystem. &lt;/i&gt;This applies for example to cumulative ratings where a &amp;quot;higher&amp;quot; rating includes all &amp;quot;lower&amp;quot; ratings.&amp;#160;However, there are reference systems where this is not true, for example in the &amp;quot;ISO 20653 - Liquid Ingress Protection&amp;quot; a component rated as IPX7 is not automatically rated IPX5 and vice versa. In these case, multiple values (&lt;i&gt;classKey&lt;/i&gt;) for a single &lt;i&gt;c&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;lass&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;classReferenceSystem&lt;/i&gt; are allowed.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Note: Most reference systems just define one class or at least some of the possible classes, but not all (e.g. the ISO 20653 defines &amp;quot;Solid Particle Protection&amp;quot; and &amp;quot;Liquid&amp;#160;Ingress&amp;#160;Protection&amp;quot;, whereas the ISO 6722 defines &amp;quot;Ambient&amp;#160;Temperature&amp;quot; among others).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_EB5FB7F3_67F4_4812_A5C6_267D4CE8F6F7'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_694528E5_1231_4d6f_A10E_09B708B8DD2B' name='class' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1493022004800_957339_2623'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_694528E5_1231_4d6f_A10E_09B708B8DD2BDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the identifier of a robustness class defined by the robustness class reference system. Robustness classes are for example: oil, petrol, UV, water. Specific known and used classes are defined in an open enumeration.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_694528E5_1231_4d6f_A10E_09B708B8DD2B'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001645_1231_4d6f_A10E_09B708B8DD2B' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001646_1231_4d6f_A10E_09B708B8DD2B' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_F862BDD1_A6F8_48fd_8C20_BFB626694045' name='classKey' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_F862BDD1_A6F8_48fd_8C20_BFB626694045Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a key for the robustness level defined in the specified robustness class (e.g. A, B, C). The classKey is the key as specified in the reference system and no additional syntax or prefixes, e.g. for ISO&amp;#160;20653 (Ingress Protection)&amp;#160;it is &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;9K&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt; and not &lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;IPX9K&amp;quot;.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F862BDD1_A6F8_48fd_8C20_BFB626694045'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001647_A6F8_48fd_8C20_BFB626694045'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001648_A6F8_48fd_8C20_BFB626694045' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_451F02B2_B7F0_412d_B451_1C9AA68AEFA8' name='classReferenceSystem' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1493021954130_593955_2603'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_451F02B2_B7F0_412d_B451_1C9AA68AEFA8Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The identification of the robustness class reference system, which is defining possible values and the semantic of robustness classes and robustness class keys. Specific known and used reference systems are defined in an open enumeration.&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_451F02B2_B7F0_412d_B451_1C9AA68AEFA8'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001649_B7F0_412d_B451_1C9AA68AEFA8' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001650_B7F0_412d_B451_1C9AA68AEFA8' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_9BA7E60E_0DA9_4a41_8CD8_FA5A1B1CE2A0' name='hasRobustness' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698654806_5864_2387'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9BA7E60E_0DA9_4a41_8CD8_FA5A1B1CE2A0Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies if the described element has a robustness in the specified robustness class.&#10;(see KBLFRM-260)&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9BA7E60E_0DA9_4a41_8CD8_FA5A1B1CE2A0'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001651_0DA9_4a41_8CD8_FA5A1B1CE2A0' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001652_0DA9_4a41_8CD8_FA5A1B1CE2A0' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_98082388_8A16_4bba_9218_60B80CE65A8D' name='description' visibility='public' type='EAID_6E33CD1B_63D7_4da8_BED4_828037944989'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_98082388_8A16_4bba_9218_60B80CE65A8DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;On optional human readable description of the robustness (e.g. the name).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_98082388_8A16_4bba_9218_60B80CE65A8D'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001653_8A16_4bba_9218_60B80CE65A8D'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001654_8A16_4bba_9218_60B80CE65A8D' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_66060FC8_2D9B_4998_8072_D11281BCFB21' name='SIUnit'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_66060FC8_2D9B_4998_8072_D11281BCFB21Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The SIUnit class can define quantities in the terms of the SI-Unit-System by specifying the corresponding SI prefix (optional) and a SI unit name. The usage of SI units must be the preferred way of expressing units, since these units can be easily translated into other SI units.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_66060FC8_2D9B_4998_8072_D11281BCFB21'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_D2E5A4C0_0723_4ab1_A7E1_5619B347FFC6' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_E9E6E5D1_05CC_427c_9FD0_4C45AAAA1066'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_D3F2460D_3F0F_49d0_BC81_ED675FB374F6' name='siUnitName' visibility='public' type='EAID_5C445750_7C2A_4c96_9FCF_896E8E433302'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_D3F2460D_3F0F_49d0_BC81_ED675FB374F6Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the name of SI unit (e.g. metre, second,...)&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_D3F2460D_3F0F_49d0_BC81_ED675FB374F6'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001655_3F0F_49d0_BC81_ED675FB374F6' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001656_3F0F_49d0_BC81_ED675FB374F6' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_01A832A7_863D_43bf_8BA5_0FAA9314D8BC' name='siPrefix' visibility='public' type='EAID_4391418A_98AB_4ae8_8A47_65D14C6AC612'>
