					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1576172392620_891833_5949' name='ACOnePhase'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1581940051205_504711_5539' name='ACTwoPhase'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1576172400676_155890_5951' name='ACThreePhase'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1576172412879_626315_5953' name='DC'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637932695624_255588_7096'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1637932695624_47236_7097'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1637932695624_758311_7098'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637932734299_297259_7112' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines a requirement for wire tuples.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1637932695624_255588_7096'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1637932695624_758311_7098' visibility='private' type='EAID_B9A2403E_EE6C_48cb_96D3_D6C4F52CDFD0' association='_19_0_2_854026d_1637932695624_255588_7096'/>
				</packagedElement>
			</packagedElement>
			<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Package' xmi:id='EAPK_6D744045_8C5E_4592_8671_951C2539E149' name='topology'>
				<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1575303845178_861684_6140' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
					<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAPK_6D744045_8C5E_4592_8671_951C2539E149'/>
				</ownedComment>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_6C665515_825C_4875_AD44_AF4795C6ADB3' name='CartesianVector' isAbstract='true'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6C665515_825C_4875_AD44_AF4795C6ADB3Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Abstract super class for vectors, either 2D or 3D.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6C665515_825C_4875_AD44_AF4795C6ADB3'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1690456764305_650933_2972' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_78BF841F_2F55_476b_9D69_604952F5471F' name='GeometryNode' isAbstract='true'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_78BF841F_2F55_476b_9D69_604952F5471FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A GeometryNode is the geometric representation of a TopologyNode. A TopologyNode may be represented by more than one GeometryNodes, but only within different &lt;i&gt;BuildingBlockSpecification2D/3D.&lt;/i&gt; That means, in a single BuildingBlockSpecification a &lt;i&gt;TopologyNode&lt;/i&gt; shall only be represent once&amp;#160;(or not).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A GeometryNode is either a GeometryNode2D or a GeometryNode3D.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_78BF841F_2F55_476b_9D69_604952F5471F'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_417106B6_82FF_48a4_AB5F_105D13FF2CE9' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_D2981BF7_2899_4491_A699_D434817A0FC2'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_85A00689_837C_41bd_A1E8_A085D988AD12' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_85A00689_837C_41bd_A1E8_A085D988AD12Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a unique identification of the GeometryNode. The identification is guaranteed to be unique within the corresponding BuildingBlockSpecification. For all VEC-documents a GeometryNode-instance can be trusted to be the same if the BuildingBlockSpecification-instance is the same (see BuildingBlockSpecification) and the identification of the GeometryNode is the same.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_85A00689_837C_41bd_A1E8_A085D988AD12'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001963_837C_41bd_A1E8_A085D988AD12' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001964_837C_41bd_A1E8_A085D988AD12' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_E49EF804_C6A8_4c25_8FFA_06D6A4B6E55B' name='aliasId' visibility='public' type='EAID_0BE66F11_D6D4_4aef_B63F_2D85865F9B68'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_E49EF804_C6A8_4c25_8FFA_06D6A4B6E55BDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies additional identifiers for the GeometryNode.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_E49EF804_C6A8_4c25_8FFA_06D6A4B6E55B'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001965_C6A8_4c25_8FFA_06D6A4B6E55B'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001966_C6A8_4c25_8FFA_06D6A4B6E55B' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst0F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1' name='referenceNode' visibility='public' type='EAID_97733D04_1F62_47fb_8ED2_0448659C560D' association='EAID_B80F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001967__7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001968__7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_B80F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst0F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src0F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B80F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1Documentation' body='References the TopologyNode that is represented by the GeometryNode.&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B80F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src0F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1' visibility='public' type='EAID_78BF841F_2F55_476b_9D69_604952F5471F' association='EAID_B80F2527_7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002015__7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002016__7221_44f3_BB96_A24A612866B1' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_479DAF86_322C_4dc9_8C35_C85DD80B6547' name='GeometrySegment' isAbstract='true'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_479DAF86_322C_4dc9_8C35_C85DD80B6547Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A GeometrySegment is the geometric representation of a TopologySegment. A TopologySegment may be represented by more than one GeometrySegments, but only within different &lt;i&gt;BuildingBlockSpecification2D/3D.&lt;/i&gt; That means, in a single BuildingBlockSpecification a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; shall only be represent once&amp;#160;(or not).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Furthermore, the definition of the &lt;i&gt;GeometrySegment&lt;/i&gt; shall be consistent to the definition in the &lt;i&gt;TopologySpecification. &lt;/i&gt;That means, that a &lt;i&gt;GeometrySegment&lt;/i&gt; shall have those &lt;i&gt;GeometryNodes &lt;/i&gt;as start- &amp;amp;&amp;#160;endNode that represent the &lt;i&gt;TopologyNodes&lt;/i&gt; referenced from the corresponding &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A GeometrySegment is either a GeometrySegment2D or a GeometrySegment3D.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_479DAF86_322C_4dc9_8C35_C85DD80B6547'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_21C668C2_8EC9_4fb0_8156_81DB2784F4FC' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_D2981BF7_2899_4491_A699_D434817A0FC2'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_BD9CA821_4C81_4197_9345_E60A385E80C2' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_BD9CA821_4C81_4197_9345_E60A385E80C2Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a unique identification of the GeometrySegment. The identification is guaranteed to be unique within the corresponding BuildingBlockSpecification. For all VEC-documents a GeometrySegment-instance can be trusted to be the same if the BuildingBlockSpecification-instance is the same (see BuildingBlockSpecification) and the identification of the GeometrySegment is the same.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_BD9CA821_4C81_4197_9345_E60A385E80C2'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001969_4C81_4197_9345_E60A385E80C2' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001970_4C81_4197_9345_E60A385E80C2' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_B64C5599_DC1B_4581_941F_42EB0428C50B' name='aliasId' visibility='public' type='EAID_0BE66F11_D6D4_4aef_B63F_2D85865F9B68'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B64C5599_DC1B_4581_941F_42EB0428C50BDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies additional identifiers for the GeometrySegment.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B64C5599_DC1B_4581_941F_42EB0428C50B'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001971_DC1B_4581_941F_42EB0428C50B'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001972_DC1B_4581_941F_42EB0428C50B' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst96D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B' name='referenceSegment' visibility='public' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='EAID_E996D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001973__FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001974__FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_E996D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst96D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src96D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_E996D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183BDocumentation' body='References the TopologySegment that is represented by the GeometrySegment. &#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_E996D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src96D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B' visibility='public' type='EAID_479DAF86_322C_4dc9_8C35_C85DD80B6547' association='EAID_E996D8C1_FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002045__FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002046__FD2E_48cb_9FF4_8A7A17AC183B' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='EAID_016015A4_FDB2_46c7_9FF6_173D0620396A' name='LengthClassification'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_016015A4_FDB2_46c7_9FF6_173D0620396ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enumeration for the definition of a LengthClassification.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_016015A4_FDB2_46c7_9FF6_173D0620396A'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_D861FA0D_9BE4_40b2_94CA_67BC06859C68' name='Designed'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_D861FA0D_9BE4_40b2_94CA_67BC06859C68Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A designed length means that the value is derived automatically in a CAD Tool (e.g. from a 3D Geometry).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_D861FA0D_9BE4_40b2_94CA_67BC06859C68'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_6296F7A8_ED11_4257_A0B3_AB49FB587A59' name='Adapted'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6296F7A8_ED11_4257_A0B3_AB49FB587A59Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;An adapted length means that the value is not the exact value taken from the CAD tool but is adapted in some way. Adapted values are supposed for further use in the process, especially as basis for the product specification. Adapted values are normally created for example by rounding the designed values.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6296F7A8_ED11_4257_A0B3_AB49FB587A59'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='EAID_0A237E73_8407_4f02_BBC7_2F0786A7BDEC' name='NodeType'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_0A237E73_8407_4f02_BBC7_2F0786A7BDECDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Enumeration for the definition of the type of a TopologyNode.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_0A237E73_8407_4f02_BBC7_2F0786A7BDEC'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_53DAE26E_74B5_4834_B97A_1B58400639A5' name='EndNode'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_53DAE26E_74B5_4834_B97A_1B58400639A5Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Electrical components are normally placed on an EndNode.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_53DAE26E_74B5_4834_B97A_1B58400639A5'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_8308AA9B_A39E_4f71_A844_6EBC0BF4344E' name='Junction'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_8308AA9B_A39E_4f71_A844_6EBC0BF4344EDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;A Junction is a TopologyNode where no electrical component is placed. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_8308AA9B_A39E_4f71_A844_6EBC0BF4344E'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_A00A512B_7C75_4d57_9B83_9E88790D7C2A' name='Inliner'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_A00A512B_7C75_4d57_9B83_9E88790D7C2ADocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;An Inliner is a TopologyNode where one section of the electrical system is connected to another section.&#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_A00A512B_7C75_4d57_9B83_9E88790D7C2A'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_934FF66A_B0A1_4784_9466_B45BE34176DC' name='SegmentCrossSectionArea'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_934FF66A_B0A1_4784_9466_B45BE34176DCDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the cross-section area of a segment. For the data exchange the cross-section area is used and not the diameter, because the diameter is only a valid measure for circular segments. For circular segments, the diameter and the cross-section area can be translated into each other without the loss of information. Attributes of the type SegmentCrossSectionArea normally have the multiplicity [0..*]. This means that such an attribute can have SegmentCrossSectionArea entries for different crossSectionAreaTypes and valueDeterminations. It must not have multiple entries with the same crossSectionAreaType and valueDetermination.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_934FF66A_B0A1_4784_9466_B45BE34176DC'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_CA3FA257_D755_42da_950F_19745A7159BA' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_2E3DFB1E_F084_42b4_92CC_B9B3E009C4BF' name='area' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_2E3DFB1E_F084_42b4_92CC_B9B3E009C4BFDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the value of the cross-section area of the segment.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_2E3DFB1E_F084_42b4_92CC_B9B3E009C4BF'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001975_F084_42b4_92CC_B9B3E009C4BF' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001976_F084_42b4_92CC_B9B3E009C4BF' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_324E662E_237C_4c66_9B38_2CEFCF143609' name='valueDetermination' visibility='public' type='EAID_87C860E0_5BCB_46d3_90AC_4E109661D5D6'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_324E662E_237C_4c66_9B38_2CEFCF143609Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the method for determination of the value.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_324E662E_237C_4c66_9B38_2CEFCF143609'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001977_237C_4c66_9B38_2CEFCF143609' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001978_237C_4c66_9B38_2CEFCF143609' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_BDA6B145_74F2_4f82_A172_A0AEDE13FB9B' name='crossSectionAreaType' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481098901178_705573_2604'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_BDA6B145_74F2_4f82_A172_A0AEDE13FB9BDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the type of the cross-section area of the segment. Different types are for example needed to differentiate between the designed space of a segment and the required space (e.g. calculated from the wires going through the segment).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Attribute is defined as an &lt;i&gt;OpenEnumeration.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_BDA6B145_74F2_4f82_A172_A0AEDE13FB9B'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001979_74F2_4f82_A172_A0AEDE13FB9B'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001980_74F2_4f82_A172_A0AEDE13FB9B' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_D2233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_D2233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282Documentation' body='Specifies the different SegmentCrossSectionAreas of the TopologySegment. &#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_D2233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282' visibility='public' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='EAID_D2233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001983__5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001984__5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='EAID_B3E54B50_F15C_4515_8BDD_FD2D324E4364' name='SegmentForm'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B3E54B50_F15C_4515_8BDD_FD2D324E4364Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Enumeration for the definition of the SegmentForm.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B3E54B50_F15C_4515_8BDD_FD2D324E4364'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_8314EB7E_7FCE_4d35_BB57_EED1AF7CA788' name='Circular'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='EAID_D2777814_F138_4c1b_948B_3FF2DA57B96A' name='NonCircular'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_E950FD84_06BB_48a1_BD17_C2EBA6F2E778' name='SegmentLength'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_E950FD84_06BB_48a1_BD17_C2EBA6F2E778Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the length of a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt;. The length of a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment &lt;/i&gt;is defined as the length of the centerline of the segment.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Attributes of the type SegmentLength normally have the multiplicity [0..*]. This means that such an attribute can have SegmentLength-entries for different classifications. It must not have multiple entries with the same classification.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_E950FD84_06BB_48a1_BD17_C2EBA6F2E778'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_4A9AE23F_D21F_477f_B112_909F34C88234' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_4C957104_CC77_47c8_86D0_969C5C729811' name='length' visibility='public' type='EAID_A946F935_0D85_4b01_92B9_625ED311C568'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_4C957104_CC77_47c8_86D0_969C5C729811Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the length of the TopologySegment. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_4C957104_CC77_47c8_86D0_969C5C729811'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001985_CC77_47c8_86D0_969C5C729811' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001986_CC77_47c8_86D0_969C5C729811' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_F3268EF7_DA17_4924_A1B7_3E7F07605EC9' name='classification' visibility='public' type='EAID_016015A4_FDB2_46c7_9FF6_173D0620396A'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_F3268EF7_DA17_4924_A1B7_3E7F07605EC9Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the classification of the segment length.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F3268EF7_DA17_4924_A1B7_3E7F07605EC9'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001987_DA17_4924_A1B7_3E7F07605EC9' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001988_DA17_4924_A1B7_3E7F07605EC9' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_BC048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_BC048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775Documentation' body='Specifies the different SegmentLengths of the TopologySegment. &#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_BC048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775' visibility='public' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='EAID_BC048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001991__32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001992__32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_10F5B908_0529_483d_98C5_0BF17B111DE3' name='TopologyGroupSpecification'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_10F5B908_0529_483d_98C5_0BF17B111DE3Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A TopologyGroupSpecification defines a new Topology based on the grouped Topologies. (see KBLFRM-240)&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_10F5B908_0529_483d_98C5_0BF17B111DE3'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_5EC686FA_CB5C_49f0_BC43_27A2223AFB95' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_CE42DF2F_1773_4aca_B7E7_163346FB9BC2'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37' name='topologySpecification' visibility='public' type='EAID_CE42DF2F_1773_4aca_B7E7_163346FB9BC2' association='EAID_8E088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001993__4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001994__4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_8E088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_8E088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37Documentation'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_8E088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37' visibility='public' type='EAID_10F5B908_0529_483d_98C5_0BF17B111DE3' association='EAID_8E088B07_4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002053__4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002054__4873_41a7_A57C_1A6320FDCB37' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_97733D04_1F62_47fb_8ED2_0448659C560D' name='TopologyNode'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_97733D04_1F62_47fb_8ED2_0448659C560DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;A TopologyNode is a point in the Topology where TopologySegments are starting and ending. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_97733D04_1F62_47fb_8ED2_0448659C560D'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_40D6D544_EA41_4c7c_B8A2_9EB27051380F' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_D2981BF7_2899_4491_A699_D434817A0FC2'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_76C8A3D5_DE51_4c58_9A80_0F84B07F79B2' name='aliasId' visibility='public' type='EAID_0BE66F11_D6D4_4aef_B63F_2D85865F9B68'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_76C8A3D5_DE51_4c58_9A80_0F84B07F79B2Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies additional identifiers for the TopologyNode.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Example: TopologyNode Ids may vary from one CAD system export to another. Therefore, the CAD system Id is improper for identification attribute. The identification shall have a value which is unique within the Topology. AliasId may be used for the CAD system Id.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_76C8A3D5_DE51_4c58_9A80_0F84B07F79B2'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001997_DE51_4c58_9A80_0F84B07F79B2'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI001998_DE51_4c58_9A80_0F84B07F79B2' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_7B658009_3D02_4846_8FD3_7843A9DE92A6' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_7B658009_3D02_4846_8FD3_7843A9DE92A6Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a unique identification of the TopologyNode. The identification is guaranteed to be unique within the TopologySpecification. For all VEC-documents a TopologyNode-instance can be trusted to be the same if the TopologySpecification-instance is the same (see TopologySpecification) and the identification of the TopologyNode is the same.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_7B658009_3D02_4846_8FD3_7843A9DE92A6'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001995_3D02_4846_8FD3_7843A9DE92A6' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001996_3D02_4846_8FD3_7843A9DE92A6' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_6D422A07_18E1_4d7f_9259_988980FE3D57' name='matchingPointId' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6D422A07_18E1_4d7f_9259_988980FE3D57Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies an identifier that can be used for matching &lt;i&gt;TopologyNodes&lt;/i&gt; that belong to different &lt;i&gt;TopologySpecifications&lt;/i&gt; and are actually representing the same node. Example: There are two &lt;i&gt;TopologySpecif&lt;/i&gt;ications, each specifying the topology of a certain zone of the car. If the zones are adjacent, it is possible that there are &lt;i&gt;TopologyNodes&lt;/i&gt; in both zones where the two topologies are connected /&amp;#160;have contact. These &amp;quot;connection-nodes&amp;quot; would then define the same &lt;i&gt;matchingPointId&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6D422A07_18E1_4d7f_9259_988980FE3D57'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI001999_18E1_4d7f_9259_988980FE3D57'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002000_18E1_4d7f_9259_988980FE3D57' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_22DD09E4_6796_4dc0_927B_98945B9768E9' name='processingInstruction' visibility='public' type='EAID_6E33CD1B_63D7_4da8_BED4_828037944989'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_22DD09E4_6796_4dc0_927B_98945B9768E9Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies processing instructions for the TopologyNode.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_22DD09E4_6796_4dc0_927B_98945B9768E9'/>
						</ownedComment>
