							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_AA108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_AA108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76Documentation' body='References the TopologyNode where the TopologySegment starts. &#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_AA108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76' visibility='public' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='EAID_AA108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002013__B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002014__B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_F21D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst1D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src1D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_F21D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190BDocumentation' body='References the TopologyNode where the TopologySegment ends. &#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_F21D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src1D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B' visibility='public' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='EAID_F21D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002017__04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002018__04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' name='TopologySegment'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; is a distance in the Topology where no intermediate electrical contacts appear. If a Topology contains routed wires, then the wire at the beginning of a TopologySegment must be the same as in the ending.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;i&gt;TopologySegments&lt;/i&gt; are a logical construct to describe the physical representation of a wiring harness topology. Therefore, a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; is only valid if it has a physical manifestation. &lt;i&gt;TopologySegments&lt;/i&gt; with a length of 0 or less do not have a physical manifestation and are therefore &lt;u&gt;not&lt;/u&gt; valid.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Additionally, the usage of &lt;i&gt;TopologySegments&lt;/i&gt; with a length of 0 create problems in the overall process. For example, the synchronization of 3D /&amp;#160;2D&amp;#160;systems becomes harder or even impossible and the handling of wire protections on those &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; is also unclear.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_11CE420A_7F5F_4dde_A22C_83D8AB0EB3E0' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_D2981BF7_2899_4491_A699_D434817A0FC2'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_2401560D_4FD9_4033_AF3D_6D44356C61AF' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_2401560D_4FD9_4033_AF3D_6D44356C61AFDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a unique identification of the TopologySegment. The identification is guaranteed to be unique within the TopologySpecification. For all VEC-documents a TopologySegment-instance can be trusted to be the same if the TopologySpecification-instance is the same (see TopologySpecification) and the identification of the TopologySegment is the same.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_2401560D_4FD9_4033_AF3D_6D44356C61AF'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002019_4FD9_4033_AF3D_6D44356C61AF' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002020_4FD9_4033_AF3D_6D44356C61AF' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_9AE0507B_8CBB_470c_95BC_FBAFE5F0E51D' name='form' visibility='public' type='EAID_B3E54B50_F15C_4515_8BDD_FD2D324E4364'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_9AE0507B_8CBB_470c_95BC_FBAFE5F0E51DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Specifies the form of the TopologySegment. A TopologySegment can either be circular or noncircular. &#10;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_9AE0507B_8CBB_470c_95BC_FBAFE5F0E51D'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002021_8CBB_470c_95BC_FBAFE5F0E51D'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1661418265162_495225_5765' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_22E6AB47_AF82_456f_84C3_CF4FB0B0D860' name='aliasId' visibility='public' type='EAID_0BE66F11_D6D4_4aef_B63F_2D85865F9B68'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_22E6AB47_AF82_456f_84C3_CF4FB0B0D860Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies additional identifiers for the TopologySegment.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Example: TopologySegment Ids may vary from one CAD system export to another. Therefore, the CAD system Id is improper for identification attribute. The identification shall have a value which is unique within the Topology. AliasId may be used for the CAD system Id.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_22E6AB47_AF82_456f_84C3_CF4FB0B0D860'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002023_AF82_456f_84C3_CF4FB0B0D860'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002024_AF82_456f_84C3_CF4FB0B0D860' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_7C8F2946_CA07_40aa_BE00_3E4BFC3226B6' name='processingInstruction' visibility='public' type='EAID_6E33CD1B_63D7_4da8_BED4_828037944989'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_7C8F2946_CA07_40aa_BE00_3E4BFC3226B6Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies processing instructions for the TopologySegment.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_7C8F2946_CA07_40aa_BE00_3E4BFC3226B6'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002025_CA07_40aa_BE00_3E4BFC3226B6'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002026_CA07_40aa_BE00_3E4BFC3226B6' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76' name='startNode' visibility='public' type='EAID_97733D04_1F62_47fb_8ED2_0448659C560D' association='EAID_AA108DDC_B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002027__B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002028__B3A1_47ec_89C8_04FE4ADB1D76' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775' name='lengthInformation' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_E950FD84_06BB_48a1_BD17_C2EBA6F2E778' association='EAID_BC048AE1_32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002029__32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002030__32D3_44da_96B6_4022DAC13775' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282' name='crossSectionAreaInformation' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_934FF66A_B0A1_4784_9466_B45BE34176DC' association='EAID_D2233592_5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002033__5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002034__5EBD_44a9_B2FC_73FF70E07282' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst1D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B' name='endNode' visibility='public' type='EAID_97733D04_1F62_47fb_8ED2_0448659C560D' association='EAID_F21D571F_04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002035__04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002036__04E1_4627_885C_68ABA23C190B' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1575890688399_637447_5392' name='instantiatedSegment' visibility='public' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='_19_0_2_854026d_1575890688398_518390_5391'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1575890716110_206757_5406'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1575890716111_735551_5407' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_B3FC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstFC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcFC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B3FC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088CDocumentation' body='Specifies the TopologySegments defined by the TopologySpecification.&#10;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B3FC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcFC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C' visibility='public' type='EAID_CE42DF2F_1773_4aca_B7E7_163346FB9BC2' association='EAID_B3FC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002043__75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002044__75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_CE42DF2F_1773_4aca_B7E7_163346FB9BC2' name='TopologySpecification'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_CE42DF2F_1773_4aca_B7E7_163346FB9BC2Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specification for the definition of a topology. A topology consists of TopologyNodes, TopologySegments.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_CE42DF2F_1773_4aca_B7E7_163346FB9BC2'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1383139591260_52605_2812' general='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29F'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst4A1F76_3CF3_45de_A731_C042DD86BD54' name='topologyNode' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_97733D04_1F62_47fb_8ED2_0448659C560D' association='EAID_9E4A1F76_3CF3_45de_A731_C042DD86BD54'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002047__3CF3_45de_A731_C042DD86BD54'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002048__3CF3_45de_A731_C042DD86BD54' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstFC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C' name='topologySegment' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='EAID_B3FC3E35_75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002051__75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002052__75BF_4b33_96A9_060A0888088C' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_B3AA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dstAA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_srcAA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_B3AA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940CDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the &lt;i&gt;TopologyZones&lt;/i&gt; that are part of the &lt;i&gt;TopologyZoneSpecification&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_B3AA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_srcAA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C' visibility='public' type='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703614817_622563_6170' association='EAID_B3AA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002071__6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002072__6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='EAID_6F40A14B_A370_4784_9F9C_5824FFBDB937' name='TopologyZone'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6F40A14B_A370_4784_9F9C_5824FFBDB937Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone&lt;/i&gt; divides a topology in different sections / design spaces. A &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone&lt;/i&gt; may be subdivided in further &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone&lt;/i&gt;. There can be multiple reasons for creating an orthogonal sectioning on a &lt;i&gt;Topology&lt;/i&gt;. Therefore, &lt;i&gt;TopologyZones&lt;/i&gt; can be overlapping.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6F40A14B_A370_4784_9F9C_5824FFBDB937'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='EAID_B3016B34_B7DF_481d_ADCE_7ADA2E3AEAD1' isSubstitutable='false' general='EAID_D2981BF7_2899_4491_A699_D434817A0FC2'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_3256CB28_10BD_4a70_9A49_AC32AA997EA2' name='identification' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382698645142_784454_2386'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_3256CB28_10BD_4a70_9A49_AC32AA997EA2Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies a unique identification of the Zone (normally the name). The identification is guaranteed to be unique within the TopologySpecification. For all VEC-documents a Zone-instance can be trusted to be the same if the TopologySpecification-instance is the same (see TopologySpecification) and the identification of the Zone is the same.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_3256CB28_10BD_4a70_9A49_AC32AA997EA2'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002055_10BD_4a70_9A49_AC32AA997EA2' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002056_10BD_4a70_9A49_AC32AA997EA2' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048607014_237317_5476' name='type' visibility='public' type='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048568515_551397_5457'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048702506_24875_5487' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The type of the TopologyZone. Valid values are defined in an OpenEnumeration.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048607014_237317_5476'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048632295_397016_5480'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048632296_73937_5481' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_6FB21781_0050_431d_A326_1E7C9755A27D' name='description' visibility='public' type='_17_0_2_854026d_1382703731024_96357_2253'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_6FB21781_0050_431d_A326_1E7C9755A27DDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies additional, human readable information about the zone.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_6FB21781_0050_431d_A326_1E7C9755A27D'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002057_0050_431d_A326_1E7C9755A27D'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_854026d_1382705356991_156183_2812' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_59ED9D64_A6A5_407c_A16F_0283645798FD' name='ambientTemperature' visibility='public' type='EAID_4F6487F1_26BD_4c01_9D1B_0657A585F66C'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_59ED9D64_A6A5_407c_A16F_0283645798FDDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the ambient temperature that can occur in this zone. This can result in specific requirements for the used components.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_59ED9D64_A6A5_407c_A16F_0283645798FD'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002059_A6A5_407c_A16F_0283645798FD'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002060_A6A5_407c_A16F_0283645798FD' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dst702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F' name='subZone' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_6F40A14B_A370_4784_9F9C_5824FFBDB937' association='EAID_5F702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002065__C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002066__C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703990552_552414_7031' name='assignment' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703876563_440629_6908' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703990551_432233_7030'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703999557_503872_7047'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703999557_888364_7048' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_730EA5DE_A4B7_401b_95BB_08FF9FDF3C26' name='requiredRobustnessProperties' visibility='public' type='EAID_EB5FB7F3_67F4_4812_A5C6_267D4CE8F6F7'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_730EA5DE_A4B7_401b_95BB_08FF9FDF3C26Documentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the robustness properties that are required in this zone. This can result in specific requirements for the used components (e.g. the ability for sealing).&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;&#10;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_730EA5DE_A4B7_401b_95BB_08FF9FDF3C26'/>
						</ownedComment>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002061_A4B7_401b_95BB_08FF9FDF3C26'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002062_A4B7_401b_95BB_08FF9FDF3C26' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='EAID_5F702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_dst702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='EAID_src702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='EAID_5F702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8FDocumentation' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specifies the sub &lt;i&gt;TopologyZones&lt;/i&gt; that are part the &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone&lt;/i&gt;. All &lt;i&gt;ZoneAssignments &lt;/i&gt;defined for subZones are automatically inherited by the parent zone.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='EAID_5F702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_src702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F' visibility='public' type='EAID_6F40A14B_A370_4784_9F9C_5824FFBDB937' association='EAID_5F702126_C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002069__C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002070__C650_4705_ADA5_89D23142DC8F' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1425916067061_629583_3069'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1425916067061_66405_3071'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1425916067061_209028_3070'/>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1425916067061_66405_3071' visibility='private' type='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1425915889398_681136_2993' association='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1425916067061_629583_3069'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1425916069970_449263_3087'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1425916069980_109585_3088' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481098901178_705573_2604' name='SegmentCrossSectionAreaType'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481099042750_207492_2656' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines valid values the type of the cross-section area of a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt;, since a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; can have different cross section areas with different meanings in the process.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481098901178_705573_2604'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481098969384_487540_2625' name='Reserved'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481099215711_746050_2657' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;i&gt;Reserved &lt;/i&gt;is the type for cross section areas that define a reserved space in the DMU&amp;#160;for the&amp;#160;&lt;i&gt;TopologySegment.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481098969384_487540_2625'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481098972698_552995_2627' name='Real'>
						<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481099371808_718522_2658' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;i&gt;Real&lt;/i&gt; is the type for cross section areas that can be observed for &lt;i&gt;TopologySegments&lt;/i&gt; with variants of a Harness that are producible.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
							<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_17_0_2_4_854026d_1481098972698_552995_2627'/>
						</ownedComment>
					</ownedLiteral>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703614817_622563_6170' name='TopologyZoneSpecification'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044763488_709743_5438' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Specification for the definition of TopologyZones.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703614817_622563_6170'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1633609188608_471305_5461' general='EAID_C8ED2BA6_456A_4d22_A483_85886F6FE29F'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='EAID_dstAA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C' name='zone' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_6F40A14B_A370_4784_9F9C_5824FFBDB937' association='EAID_B3AA9510_6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='EAID_LI002049__6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='EAID_LI002050__6309_4807_89E8_D92A394E940C' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703876563_440629_6908' name='ZoneAssignment'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573045532784_758545_5451' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;ZoneAssignment &lt;/i&gt;defines that a specific TopologySegment is affected by the &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone.&lt;/i&gt; If a coverage is defined, only the parts of the Segment that have a coverage are affected. If no coverage is defined, the whole segment is affected.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703876563_440629_6908'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1690457696255_30041_3387' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704006609_175276_7058' name='assignedSegment' visibility='public' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704006609_84293_7057'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704200515_151634_7074' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704200515_439353_7075' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704283318_951120_7180' name='coverage' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704249603_859719_7120' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704283318_184679_7179'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044555925_612697_5422'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044555925_637229_5423' value='*'/>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704249603_859719_7120' name='ZoneCoverage'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573046057497_347542_5453' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;ZoneCoverage &lt;/i&gt;defines an area on a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; that lies within a &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone.&lt;/i&gt; The area is defined with two &lt;i&gt;Locations&lt;/i&gt;. &lt;i&gt;Locations &lt;/i&gt;are the same mechanism that is used to define placements for components. The area that is in the &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone &lt;/i&gt;is the area between the two locations. There is no semantic in the direction of the definition, so the assignment of first &amp;amp;&amp;#160;second Location is completely arbitrary. &#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;However, there are some restrictions for the definition of the locations. All locations have to be in relation to the&amp;#160;&lt;i&gt;TopologySegment &lt;/i&gt;that is referenced by the containing &lt;i&gt;ZoneAssignment&lt;/i&gt;. This means the &lt;i&gt;Locations&lt;/i&gt; have to be either a &lt;i&gt;SegmentLocation on the &lt;/i&gt;respective&lt;i&gt; &lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; or a &lt;i&gt;NodeLocation&lt;/i&gt; on the start or end node of this particular &lt;i&gt;T&lt;/i&gt;&lt;i&gt;opologySegment.&lt;/i&gt; A &lt;i&gt;ZoneCoverage&lt;/i&gt; from start to end node of a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; is equivalent to the complete omission of &lt;i&gt;ZoneCoverages&lt;/i&gt; for a particular &lt;i&gt;ZoneAssignment&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&amp;#160;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704249603_859719_7120'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1690457702364_490241_3388' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703923349_241449_6977' name='firstLocation' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_1F2FCC66_9C3D_45ca_96DF_6158D08B3A75' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703923349_602348_6976'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703933275_975686_6999' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703933275_858357_7000' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703918087_447801_6956' name='secondLocation' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_1F2FCC66_9C3D_45ca_96DF_6158D08B3A75' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703918087_955900_6955'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703930476_369868_6993' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703930476_782319_6994' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703990551_432233_7030'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703990552_552414_7031'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703990552_679631_7032'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573045372740_603294_5449' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The assignments of specific topology elements to this zone.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703990551_432233_7030'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703990552_679631_7032' visibility='private' type='EAID_6F40A14B_A370_4784_9F9C_5824FFBDB937' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703990551_432233_7030'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704006609_84293_7057'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704006609_175276_7058'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704006609_129223_7059'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573045435080_325764_5450' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;The &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; that is assigned to &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone&lt;/i&gt; with this &lt;i&gt;ZoneAssignment.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704006609_84293_7057'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704006609_129223_7059' visibility='private' type='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703876563_440629_6908' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704006609_84293_7057'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704208897_202924_7080'/>
						<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704208898_337661_7081' value='*'/>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704283318_184679_7179'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704283318_951120_7180'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704283318_662960_7181'/>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573045731531_732528_5452' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Contains a set of &lt;i&gt;ZoneCoverages&lt;/i&gt; that define the areas of a &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; that is affected by the TopologyZone.&amp;#160;If no coverage is defined, the complete segment is affected. Multiple coverages can be necessary if the &lt;i&gt;TopologySegment&lt;/i&gt; zigzags in and out of the &lt;i&gt;TopologyZone.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704283318_184679_7179'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704283318_662960_7181' visibility='private' type='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703876563_440629_6908' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704283318_184679_7179'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044561114_237752_5426' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044561114_494505_5427' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703918087_955900_6955'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703918087_447801_6956'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703918087_764485_6957'/>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703918087_764485_6957' visibility='private' type='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704249603_859719_7120' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703918087_955900_6955'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044582290_692463_5430'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044582290_984395_5431' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Association' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703923349_602348_6976'>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703923349_241449_6977'/>
					<memberEnd xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703923350_962149_6978'/>
					<ownedEnd xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703923350_962149_6978' visibility='private' type='_18_5_2_854026d_1542704249603_859719_7120' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1542703923349_602348_6976'>
						<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044589698_878324_5434'/>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573044589698_5392_5435' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedEnd>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Enumeration' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048568515_551397_5457' name='TopologyZoneType'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048750790_804159_5488' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;There can be various reasons to define TopologyZones. These can be differentiated with these type literals.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048568515_551397_5457'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048674694_864511_5483' name='DmuZone'/>
					<ownedLiteral xmi:type='uml:EnumerationLiteral' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1573048683745_115380_5485' name='EnvironmentZone'/>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439358968_998817_7180' name='NodeMapping'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1575308052514_77947_6145' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the relationship of an inner node to its outer topology. The relationship to the outer topology is expressed with a &lt;i&gt;Location&lt;/i&gt;.&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439358968_998817_7180'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1690457147310_892060_3314' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439376489_920962_7207' name='innerNode' visibility='public' type='EAID_97733D04_1F62_47fb_8ED2_0448659C560D' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439376489_539955_7206'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439381297_246182_7223' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439381297_331589_7224' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439416531_574379_7244' name='mappedPosition' visibility='public' aggregation='composite' type='EAID_1F2FCC66_9C3D_45ca_96DF_6158D08B3A75' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439416531_663295_7243'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439420961_245464_7260' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439420962_104767_7261' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
				</packagedElement>
				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439478622_146727_7306' name='SegmentMapping'>
					<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
						<modelExtension/>
					</xmi:Extension>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1575307954053_598605_6144' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;Defines the relationship of an inner segment to its outer topology. The relationship to the outer topology is expressed with a &lt;i&gt;Path.&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#10;&lt;i&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/i&gt;&#10;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439478622_146727_7306'/>
					</ownedComment>
					<generalization xmi:type='uml:Generalization' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1690457591926_396163_3381' general='EAID_F89D215A_BDE4_4335_841E_9CDDF0672665'/>
					<ownedAttribute xmi:type='uml:Property' xmi:id='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439505207_503708_7360' name='innerSegment' visibility='public' type='EAID_0A544C53_306B_4fd6_85BF_FF10223E18E9' association='_18_5_2_854026d_1558439505207_389043_7359'>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<lowerValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralInteger' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1575302626242_802583_5803' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
						<xmi:Extension extender='MagicDraw UML 2022x'>
							<modelExtension>
								<upperValue xmi:type='uml:LiteralUnlimitedNatural' xmi:id='_19_0_2_854026d_1575302626242_399263_5804' value='1'/>
							</modelExtension>
						</xmi:Extension>
					</ownedAttribute>
