				<packagedElement xmi:type='uml:Class' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1703760511489_657786_4789' name='SignalGraphNode'>
					<ownedComment xmi:type='uml:Comment' xmi:id='_2022x_1_854026d_1704700752950_708497_1695' body='&lt;html&gt;&#10;  &lt;head&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;style&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;p {padding:0px; margin:0px;}&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/style&gt;&#10;&#9;&lt;/head&gt;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#10;A &lt;i&gt;SignalGraphNode&lt;/i&gt; represent some physical element that participates in the signal transmission related to a &lt;i&gt;SignalGraph&lt;/i&gt;. If the &lt;i&gt;representedElement&lt;/i&gt; fails or is not present in a network, some paths in the &lt;i&gt;SignalGraph&lt;/i&gt; maybe disrupted.&lt;/body&gt;&#10;&lt;/html&gt;'>
						<annotatedElement xmi:idref='_2022x_1_854026d_1703760511489_657786_4789'/>
					</ownedComment>
